{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01KEHhz4esbYGbozRbkjqMHq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed predicted results for each planned experiment in the experiment plan, assuming the \"best\" tier outcome. I need to provide specific metric predictions with rationales explaining why those results would occur under the best-case scenario where all three core claims fully hold.\n\nLet me carefully go through each experiment and generate detailed predictions.\n\nLet me think through each experiment:\n\n**exp-001: HB EC-HTE on synthetic data**\n- This is the primary validation of Claim 2 (EC-HTE solution)\n- Best tier: HB partial pooling significantly outperforms MLE/Laplace, especially at small n\n\n\n- MCMC diagnostics pass cleanly with strong RMSE reduction versus MLE at n=250, solid coverage rates, and clean convergence diagnostics\n\n**exp-002: Formal bias bound verification**\n- Validates Claim 1 (bias mechanism)\n- Best tier: Analytic prediction matches MC perfectly (R² ≥ 0.95), K=4 extension works\n- \"Debiasing can hurt\" proposition clearly demonstrated\n\n**exp-003: Semi-synthetic benchmark**\n- Primary empirical evidence for all claims\n- Real LLM annotations show heterogeneous error rates\n- EC-HTE dramatically outperforms global correction\n\n**exp-004: Real-data validation**\n- Confirms findings on refugee interview data with EC-HTE recovering corrected CATEs\n\n**exp-005 through exp-011**\n- Diagnostic criterion validation with strong ROC analysis, expert label budget sensitivity showing the crossover point and partial pooling benefits, PPCI baseline comparison demonstrating orthogonality, multiple LLM comparison revealing quality-dependent benefits, adaptive allocation outperforming uniform strategies, and robustness checks for misspecified subgroups and causal forest integration\n\nNow I'm setting up the detailed predictions with specific numbers targeting the best tier performance metrics.\n\nWriting YAML configuration...","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10103,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10103},"output_tokens":26,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d3e925fc-24dd-4c87-b2ac-ec185e0a37c4","uuid":"42a1ceb8-425c-4f6d-a2ae-0837bfef5363"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01KEHhz4esbYGbozRbkjqMHq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 完全成立。论文以 problem-discovery 定位：首次识别并形式化 measurement-error × causal-heterogeneity\n  confounding，Δπ×Δτ product 诊断准则有独立实用价值。Headline result 可直接使用（\"global correction\n  worsens bias by up to 7.8x\"）。PPCI 正交性干净，K>2 扩展自然，HB partial pooling 在小样本下优势显著。\n  论文结构 Theory → Synthetic → Semi-synthetic → Real data 全链条闭合，无需防守性让步。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Hierarchical Bayesian EC-HTE synthetic validation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-001\"\n    description: >\n      在合成数据上实现 HB Dirichlet-prior confusion matrix estimator，与 MLE stratified 和 Laplace smoothed\n      基线对比。覆盖 extreme/moderate/homogeneous error regimes × n_expert ∈ {100,250,500,1000,2000}\n      × K ∈ {2,4} subgroups，共 1000 次 MC 重复。PyMC NUTS sampler，4 chains，warmup=1000。\n    expected_results:\n      hb_rmse_vs_mle_at_n100_k2: 0.72  # HB RMSE / MLE RMSE，即 28% reduction\n      hb_rmse_vs_mle_at_n250_k2: 0.74  # 26% reduction\n      hb_rmse_vs_mle_at_n250_k4: 0.68  # 32% reduction，K=4 时 MLE 方差膨胀更严重\n      hb_rmse_vs_mle_at_n1000_k2: 0.91  # 大样本下 HB 收缩减弱，优势缩小\n      hb_rmse_vs_mle_at_n2000_k2: 0.96  # 几乎无差异\n      hb_coverage_95ci_extreme_n250: 0.943\n      hb_coverage_95ci_moderate_n250: 0.951\n      hb_coverage_95ci_homogeneous_n250: 0.954\n      mle_coverage_95ci_extreme_n250: 0.87  # MLE 小样本下严重 undercoverage\n      laplace_coverage_95ci_extreme_n250: 0.91\n      ec_hte_subgroup_bias_extreme: 0.003  # 近零 bias（绝对值）\n      global_correction_subgroup_bias_extreme: 0.041  # 显著 bias\n      rhat_max: 1.004\n      ess_min: 387\n      mcmc_runtime_per_fit_seconds: 2.3\n      mle_runtime_per_fit_seconds: 0.008\n      mc_runs: 1000\n    result_rationale: >\n      HB Dirichlet partial pooling 在小样本下的优势来自两个机制：(1) 当 n_expert ≤ 250 时，per-subgroup\n      confusion matrix 的 MLE 估计面临严重的有限样本方差——K=4 时每个 subgroup 仅 ~62 个标注，2×2 矩阵\n      4 个参数的 MLE 方差很大，矩阵求逆进一步放大误差；HB 通过向全局先验收缩，借用跨 subgroup 信息，\n      有效降低估计方差。(2) Coverage 改善因为 HB 的后验区间自然包含参数不确定性，而 MLE 的 delta-method CI\n      在小样本下低估方差。随着 n_expert → 2000，每个 subgroup 有充足数据，MLE 渐近最优性使 HB 优势消失。\n      Extreme regime 下 HB 优势最大，因为 subgroup 间 error rate 差异大（π₁=0.15 vs π₂=0.35），\n      MLE 在低频 subgroup 上方差爆炸。MCMC 收敛良好因为 Dirichlet-Multinomial 是共轭结构，\n      posterior geometry 简单，NUTS 无困难。Runtime 比 MLE 慢 ~300x 但绝对值仍可接受。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 1: RMSE comparison across methods, regimes, and sample sizes (K=2)\"\n        columns: [\"regime\", \"n_expert\", \"MLE_RMSE\", \"Laplace_RMSE\", \"HB_RMSE\", \"HB/MLE_ratio\", \"HB_95CI_coverage\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"extreme\", 100, 0.058, 0.049, 0.042, 0.72, 0.932]\n          - [\"extreme\", 250, 0.037, 0.032, 0.027, 0.74, 0.943]\n          - [\"extreme\", 500, 0.024, 0.022, 0.020, 0.83, 0.948]\n          - [\"extreme\", 1000, 0.016, 0.015, 0.015, 0.91, 0.952]\n          - [\"extreme\", 2000, 0.011, 0.011, 0.011, 0.96, 0.953]\n          - [\"moderate\", 100, 0.041, 0.036, 0.031, 0.76, 0.938]\n          - [\"moderate\", 250, 0.027, 0.024, 0.021, 0.78, 0.951]\n          - [\"moderate\", 500, 0.018, 0.017, 0.016, 0.87, 0.953]\n          - [\"moderate\", 1000, 0.012, 0.012, 0.011, 0.93, 0.954]\n          - [\"moderate\", 2000, 0.009, 0.009, 0.008, 0.97, 0.953]\n          - [\"homogeneous\", 100, 0.032, 0.029, 0.027, 0.84, 0.944]\n          - [\"homogeneous\", 250, 0.021, 0.020, 0.019, 0.88, 0.954]\n          - [\"homogeneous\", 500, 0.015, 0.014, 0.014, 0.93, 0.955]\n          - [\"homogeneous\", 1000, 0.010, 0.010, 0.010, 0.97, 0.954]\n          - [\"homogeneous\", 2000, 0.007, 0.007, 0.007, 0.99, 0.953]\n      - title: \"Table 2: K=4 subgroups results (extreme regime)\"\n        columns: [\"n_expert\", \"MLE_RMSE\", \"HB_RMSE\", \"HB/MLE_ratio\", \"HB_coverage\", \"MLE_coverage\"]\n        rows:\n          - [100, 0.089, 0.058, 0.65, 0.921, 0.82]\n          - [250, 0.054, 0.037, 0.68, 0.940, 0.86]\n          - [500, 0.035, 0.027, 0.77, 0.949, 0.91]\n          - [1000, 0.023, 0.020, 0.87, 0.953, 0.94]\n          - [2000, 0.016, 0.015, 0.94, 0.954, 0.95]\n      - title: \"Table 3: MCMC diagnostics summary\"\n        columns: [\"metric\", \"min\", \"median\", \"max\", \"threshold\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"R̂\", 1.000, 1.001, 1.004, \"<1.01\"]\n          - [\"ESS (bulk)\", 387, 1240, 4000, \">200\"]\n          - [\"ESS (tail)\", 302, 980, 3500, \">200\"]\n          - [\"divergences\", 0, 0, 0, \"0\"]\n          - [\"runtime (s)\", 1.1, 2.3, 4.7, \"-\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 1a: HB/MLE RMSE ratio vs n_expert 折线图，三条线对应 extreme/moderate/homogeneous regimes，K=2。展示 HB 优势随 n 增大而收敛至 1.0 的渐近行为。\"\n      - \"Fig 1b: Coverage calibration plot，nominal 95% CI 下 HB/MLE/Laplace 三种方法的 empirical coverage vs n_expert。MLE 在小样本下系统性 undercoverage。\"\n      - \"Fig 1c: K=2 vs K=4 对比，HB/MLE ratio vs n_expert，展示 K=4 时 HB 优势更显著。\"\n    analysis: >\n      核心发现：HB partial pooling 在 n_expert ≤ 250 时提供 22-35% RMSE reduction（取决于 regime 和 K），\n      且 coverage 始终在 [0.92, 0.96] 范围内。K=4 时优势更显著，因为 per-subgroup 样本量减半导致 MLE\n      方差翻倍。这直接支撑 Claim 2 中\"partial pooling controls estimation variance\"的论断。\n      Homogeneous regime 下 HB 优势最小（收缩方向与真实值接近），但不会更差——验证\"never worse than global\"性质。\n      MCMC 诊断全部通过，无需担心计算可靠性。\n\n  - name: \"Formal bias bound verification with K>2 extension\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-002\"\n    description: >\n      解析推导 bias = Σ_k w_k · (π_global - π_k) · τ_k 的形式化表达，其中 π_k 是 subgroup k 的\n      misclassification rate，τ_k 是 subgroup CATE。K=2 时简化为 bias ∝ Δπ × Δτ。\n      在系统参数网格上（Δπ ∈ [0, 0.3], Δτ ∈ [0, 0.5], base rates 变化）进行 MC 验证。\n      K=4 扩展验证 sum-of-products 形式。\n    expected_results:\n      analytic_vs_mc_r_squared_k2: 0.982\n      analytic_vs_mc_r_squared_k4: 0.971\n      bound_tightness_ratio_median: 1.03  # analytic / empirical，接近 1 表示 tight\n      bound_tightness_ratio_95pct: 1.12\n      bias_amplification_max_observed: 7.8  # global correction bias / no correction bias\n      bias_amplification_mean_extreme: 6.2\n      bias_amplification_mean_moderate: 3.1  # moderate regime 下仍有显著放大但不到 5x\n      debiasing_hurts_fraction_extreme: 0.94  # extreme regime 下 94% 的 grid points global correction 更差\n      debiasing_hurts_fraction_moderate: 0.67\n      constructive_example_bias_nocorrection: 0.023\n      constructive_example_bias_global: 0.179  # 7.8x amplification\n      constructive_example_bias_ec_hte: 0.002\n      k4_sum_of_products_empirical_match: 0.97  # correlation between predicted and observed\n    result_rationale: >\n      解析 bound 与 MC 高度吻合（R² > 0.97）的原因：在 K=2 binary classification 下，bias 的 closed-form\n      表达 bias_global = (π̂_global - π₁)·τ₁·w₁ + (π̂_global - π₂)·τ₂·w₂ 是精确的，不依赖渐近近似。\n      π̂_global = w₁π₁ + w₂π₂ 代入后得到 bias ∝ w₁w₂·Δπ·Δτ 的乘积形式。MC 偏离仅来自有限样本\n      confusion matrix 估计噪声，随 MC 重复次数增多趋于零。R² 未达 1.0 是因为 base rate 和 sample size\n      引入的二阶效应。K=4 时 R² 略低因为 sum-of-products 形式有更多交叉项，但核心结构不变。\n      Bias amplification 7.8x 出现在 constructive example 中：π₁=0.10, π₂=0.35, τ₁=0.15, τ₂=0.02\n      ——low-error subgroup 有大 treatment effect，global correction 用 π̂_global≈0.22 严重过校正该 subgroup，\n      而 high-error subgroup 的 small τ₂ 意味着欠校正损害小。净效果：global correction 在 subgroup 1 引入\n      大 bias，远超 no correction 下的原始 bias。这是本文最核心的 insight。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 4: Analytic bound vs MC empirical bias (K=2, selected grid points)\"\n        columns: [\"Δπ\", \"Δτ\", \"bias_analytic\", \"bias_mc_mean\", \"bias_mc_se\", \"ratio\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0.05, 0.10, 0.006, 0.006, 0.001, 1.01]\n          - [0.10, 0.10, 0.013, 0.012, 0.001, 1.02]\n          - [0.10, 0.30, 0.038, 0.037, 0.002, 1.03]\n          - [0.20, 0.20, 0.050, 0.049, 0.002, 1.02]\n          - [0.20, 0.40, 0.100, 0.097, 0.003, 1.03]\n          - [0.25, 0.50, 0.156, 0.149, 0.004, 1.05]\n          - [0.30, 0.50, 0.188, 0.179, 0.005, 1.05]\n      - title: \"Table 5: Bias amplification factor (global/no-correction) by regime\"\n        columns: [\"regime\", \"Δπ\", \"Δτ\", \"bias_no_corr\", \"bias_global\", \"amplification\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"extreme\", 0.25, 0.13, 0.023, 0.179, \"7.8x\"]\n          - [\"extreme\", 0.20, 0.15, 0.019, 0.118, \"6.2x\"]\n          - [\"extreme\", 0.15, 0.20, 0.015, 0.080, \"5.3x\"]\n          - [\"moderate\", 0.10, 0.10, 0.008, 0.025, \"3.1x\"]\n          - [\"homogeneous\", 0.03, 0.05, 0.001, 0.002, \"1.5x\"]\n      - title: \"Table 6: K=4 sum-of-products verification\"\n        columns: [\"config\", \"bias_predicted\", \"bias_mc\", \"abs_error\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"balanced, linear Δπ\", 0.062, 0.060, 0.002]\n          - [\"balanced, quadratic Δπ\", 0.084, 0.081, 0.003]\n          - [\"unbalanced, linear Δπ\", 0.071, 0.068, 0.003]\n          - [\"unbalanced, quadratic Δπ\", 0.098, 0.093, 0.005]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 2: Bias amplification heatmap，x 轴 Δπ ∈ [0, 0.3]，y 轴 Δτ ∈ [0, 0.5]，颜色表示 amplification factor。清晰展示乘积结构：等高线近似双曲线 Δπ×Δτ = const。右上角深红（>7x），左下角白色（<2x）。Headline figure for paper.\"\n      - \"Fig 3: Constructive example bar chart，三组 bar（No correction / Global / EC-HTE）× 两个 subgroups，展示 global correction 如何在 low-error subgroup 引入巨大 bias 而 EC-HTE 消除之。\"\n      - \"Fig 4: K=4 scatter plot，analytic predicted bias vs MC observed bias，45° line，R²=0.971。\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是论文的理论基础实验。R² ≈ 0.98 证明 Δπ×Δτ product 形式不是近似而是（在 population 层面）精确的，\n      MC 偏离仅反映有限样本噪声。Bias amplification 最高 7.8x 出现在 extreme regime 的特定配置下，\n      这成为论文 headline number。K=4 扩展验证 sum-of-products Σ_k w_k(π̄-π_k)τ_k 形式同样成立，\n      R²=0.971 略低但仍远超阈值。这为 Remark 1（general-K case）提供实证支持。\n      关键洞察：amplification 在 Δπ 和 Δτ 都大时最严重，但即使中等水平（Δπ=0.10, Δτ=0.10）\n      也有 3.1x 放大，说明问题不限于极端情况。\n\n  - name: \"Semi-synthetic political-science benchmark\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-003\"\n    description: >\n      使用 CardiffNLP TweetEval sentiment/stance 子集或类似公开政治推文语料，注入已知 CATE 异质性结构\n      （如 economic framing 调节 campaign message 效果）。用 GPT-4.1 和 Qwen3-235B-A22B 标注 effect modifier，\n      测量 subgroup-specific misclassification rates，验证异质性存在。应用 EC-HTE vs Global vs No-correction\n      vs MLE-stratified baselines。N ≈ 20000 tweets, n_expert = 500 gold labels。\n    expected_results:\n      gpt4_overall_accuracy: 0.87\n      gpt4_subgroup_accuracy_high: 0.93\n      gpt4_subgroup_accuracy_low: 0.78\n      gpt4_max_min_error_ratio: 2.15  # (1-0.78)/(1-0.93) = 3.14，但以 misclass rate ratio 计\n      qwen3_overall_accuracy: 0.82\n      qwen3_subgroup_accuracy_high: 0.89\n      qwen3_subgroup_accuracy_low: 0.72\n      qwen3_max_min_error_ratio: 2.55\n      ec_hte_cate_bias_subgroup1_gpt4: 0.004\n      ec_hte_cate_bias_subgroup2_gpt4: 0.006\n      global_cate_bias_subgroup1_gpt4: 0.038\n      global_cate_bias_subgroup2_gpt4: -0.031\n      nocorrection_cate_bias_subgroup1_gpt4: 0.012\n      nocorrection_cate_bias_subgroup2_gpt4: -0.018\n      bias_amplification_global_gpt4: 5.4\n      bias_amplification_global_qwen3: 6.9\n      ec_hte_coverage_gpt4: 0.94\n      ec_hte_coverage_qwen3: 0.93\n      ec_hte_bias_reduction_vs_global_gpt4: 0.89  # 1 - ec_hte_bias/global_bias\n      ec_hte_bias_reduction_vs_global_qwen3: 0.92\n      subgroup_misclass_heterogeneity_gpt4: 0.15  # |π₁ - π₂|\n      subgroup_misclass_heterogeneity_qwen3: 0.17\n    result_rationale: >\n      GPT-4.1 在政治推文分类上总体准确率约 87%，但在不同 subgroup 上存在显著异质性：对主流经济议题\n      （high-resource subgroup）准确率 93%，对少数族裔/移民相关议题（low-resource subgroup）准确率仅 78%。\n      这种异质性来源于训练数据分布——主流议题在预训练语料中出现频率远高于边缘议题。Qwen3 作为非英语中心模型，\n      整体准确率略低但异质性模式类似。error ratio ≥ 1.5 的核心假设成立（实际 ratio 更高）。\n      Global correction 使用 π̂≈0.13（GPT-4.1）对所有 subgroup 校正：对 high-accuracy subgroup（真实 π=0.07）\n      过校正，对 low-accuracy subgroup（真实 π=0.22）欠校正，产生系统性 bias 在 subgroup 层面放大 5-7x。\n      EC-HTE 使用 stratified confusion matrix（由 500 expert labels 估计，HB pooling）正确校正各 subgroup，\n      residual bias 仅来自有限样本 confusion matrix 估计误差。Coverage 94% 因为 HB posterior CI\n      正确传播了 confusion matrix 不确定性。Qwen3 amplification 更高因为异质性更大。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 7: Subgroup-specific LLM misclassification rates\"\n        columns: [\"LLM\", \"subgroup\", \"n\", \"accuracy\", \"FPR\", \"FNR\", \"misclass_rate\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GPT-4.1\", \"economic-mainstream\", 11200, 0.93, 0.04, 0.10, 0.07]\n          - [\"GPT-4.1\", \"minority-immigration\", 8800, 0.78, 0.12, 0.31, 0.22]\n          - [\"GPT-4.1\", \"pooled\", 20000, 0.87, 0.07, 0.19, 0.13]\n          - [\"Qwen3-235B\", \"economic-mainstream\", 11200, 0.89, 0.06, 0.16, 0.11]\n          - [\"Qwen3-235B\", \"minority-immigration\", 8800, 0.72, 0.15, 0.40, 0.28]\n          - [\"Qwen3-235B\", \"pooled\", 20000, 0.82, 0.10, 0.26, 0.18]\n      - title: \"Table 8: CATE estimation comparison (GPT-4.1 annotations)\"\n        columns: [\"method\", \"subgroup\", \"CATE_true\", \"CATE_est\", \"bias\", \"RMSE\", \"coverage_95\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"No correction\", \"economic-mainstream\", 0.150, 0.138, -0.012, 0.018, 0.89]\n          - [\"No correction\", \"minority-immigration\", 0.040, 0.058, 0.018, 0.023, 0.85]\n          - [\"Global correction\", \"economic-mainstream\", 0.150, 0.188, 0.038, 0.042, 0.71]\n          - [\"Global correction\", \"minority-immigration\", 0.040, 0.009, -0.031, 0.035, 0.76]\n          - [\"MLE stratified\", \"economic-mainstream\", 0.150, 0.153, 0.003, 0.021, 0.91]\n          - [\"MLE stratified\", \"minority-immigration\", 0.040, 0.044, 0.004, 0.019, 0.90]\n          - [\"EC-HTE (HB)\", \"economic-mainstream\", 0.150, 0.154, 0.004, 0.014, 0.94]\n          - [\"EC-HTE (HB)\", \"minority-immigration\", 0.040, 0.046, 0.006, 0.012, 0.95]\n      - title: \"Table 9: Same comparison with Qwen3-235B\"\n        columns: [\"method\", \"subgroup\", \"CATE_true\", \"CATE_est\", \"bias\", \"RMSE\", \"coverage_95\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"No correction\", \"economic-mainstream\", 0.150, 0.133, -0.017, 0.023, 0.86]\n          - [\"No correction\", \"minority-immigration\", 0.040, 0.065, 0.025, 0.030, 0.81]\n          - [\"Global correction\", \"economic-mainstream\", 0.150, 0.201, 0.051, 0.055, 0.63]\n          - [\"Global correction\", \"minority-immigration\", 0.040, -0.003, -0.043, 0.048, 0.68]\n          - [\"EC-HTE (HB)\", \"economic-mainstream\", 0.150, 0.155, 0.005, 0.016, 0.93]\n          - [\"EC-HTE (HB)\", \"minority-immigration\", 0.040, 0.047, 0.007, 0.014, 0.93]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 5: Bias mechanism schematic——左侧展示 global correction 对两个 subgroup 的 over/under-correction 方向与幅度，右侧展示 EC-HTE stratified correction 消除 bias。Arrow diagram。\"\n      - \"Fig 6: Grouped bar chart，4 methods × 2 subgroups × 2 LLMs，y 轴为 |bias|，展示 global correction 在所有 subgroup 上 bias 最大。\"\n      - \"Fig 7: Coverage vs nominal level calibration plot，EC-HTE 点在对角线附近，Global 系统性低于对角线。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Semi-synthetic 实验是论文的核心实证。两个 LLM 在真实政治推文上确实展现显著的 subgroup 异质性\n      （error ratio 2.15x 和 2.55x，远超 1.5x 假设阈值），验证了问题的现实性。Global correction\n      不仅未改善 CATE 估计，反而使 bias 恶化 5-7x——这是论文最有力的 headline result。\n      EC-HTE 在两个 LLM 上都将 bias 降至近零（reduction 89-92%），coverage 维持在 93-95%，\n      同时 RMSE 也优于 MLE stratified（因 HB partial pooling 降低方差）。\n      GPT-4.1 结果好于 Qwen3 因为基础准确率更高，但即使对 GPT-4.1 这种高质量 LLM，\n      global correction 仍然有害——强化\"问题普遍存在\"的论点。\n\n  - name: \"Real-data validation on Ashwin et al. (2025)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-004\"\n    description: >\n      在 Ashwin et al. (2025) Rohingya 难民访谈数据集上应用 EC-HTE。该数据集中 LLM 标注错误\n      与 refugee status、gender、education 相关。使用 GPT-4.1 和 Qwen3 标注 effect modifiers，\n      获取/模拟 expert labels（200-500 条），比较 EC-HTE vs baselines 的 CATE 估计。\n    expected_results:\n      refugee_status_error_rate_gpt4: 0.11\n      host_community_error_rate_gpt4: 0.21\n      female_error_rate_gpt4: 0.18\n      male_error_rate_gpt4: 0.09\n      low_education_error_rate_gpt4: 0.24\n      high_education_error_rate_gpt4: 0.08\n      max_min_error_ratio_by_status: 1.91\n      max_min_error_ratio_by_gender: 2.00\n      max_min_error_ratio_by_education: 3.00\n      global_vs_nocorrection_amplification_status: 4.2\n      global_vs_nocorrection_amplification_gender: 5.1\n      global_vs_nocorrection_amplification_education: 6.7\n      ec_hte_bias_reduction_status: 0.87\n      ec_hte_bias_reduction_gender: 0.91\n      ec_hte_bias_reduction_education: 0.93\n      ec_hte_coverage_status: 0.93\n      ec_hte_coverage_gender: 0.94\n    result_rationale: >\n      Ashwin et al. (2025) 已文献记录 LLM 标注错误与人口学特征的相关性。Education 维度异质性最大\n      （ratio 3.0x）因为低教育受访者使用非标准语言、方言混杂，LLM 理解困难；refugee status 次之\n      （ratio 1.91x）因为难民受访者的创伤性叙述增加标注难度。Gender 维度的异质性来源于女性受访者\n      更多涉及家庭暴力等敏感话题，LLM 在情感分类上表现更差。\n      Global correction amplification 在 education 维度最高（6.7x）因为 Δπ 和 Δτ 都大——\n      低教育群体同时有高 misclassification 和不同的 treatment effect pattern。\n      EC-HTE 在所有维度上有效但改善幅度不如合成数据大（因为 n_expert 有限且真实数据更嘈杂），\n      education 维度上 reduction 最高因为异质性最大、correction 价值最高。\n      Coverage 略低于合成实验因为真实数据可能存在模型未捕捉的额外异质性。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 10: Subgroup-specific misclassification rates by demographic dimension\"\n        columns: [\"dimension\", \"subgroup\", \"n\", \"misclass_rate_gpt4\", \"misclass_rate_qwen3\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"refugee_status\", \"refugee\", 1200, 0.11, 0.16]\n          - [\"refugee_status\", \"host_community\", 800, 0.21, 0.29]\n          - [\"gender\", \"male\", 950, 0.09, 0.14]\n          - [\"gender\", \"female\", 1050, 0.18, 0.25]\n          - [\"education\", \"high\", 600, 0.08, 0.12]\n          - [\"education\", \"low\", 1400, 0.24, 0.33]\n      - title: \"Table 11: CATE correction results by dimension (GPT-4.1, education subgroup)\"\n        columns: [\"method\", \"subgroup\", \"CATE_est\", \"bias_est\", \"RMSE\", \"coverage\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"No correction\", \"high_edu\", \"0.082\", \"-0.008\", \"0.015\", \"0.90\"]\n          - [\"No correction\", \"low_edu\", \"0.031\", \"0.019\", \"0.024\", \"0.83\"]\n          - [\"Global correction\", \"high_edu\", \"0.082 → 0.135\", \"0.045\", \"0.049\", \"0.65\"]\n          - [\"Global correction\", \"low_edu\", \"0.031 → -0.012\", \"-0.062\", \"0.067\", \"0.58\"]\n          - [\"EC-HTE\", \"high_edu\", \"0.082 → 0.093\", \"0.003\", \"0.013\", \"0.94\"]\n          - [\"EC-HTE\", \"low_edu\", \"0.031 → 0.054\", \"0.004\", \"0.014\", \"0.93\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 8: 三维度（status/gender/education）的 misclassification rate heterogeneity paired dot plot，每个维度两个点连线，展示真实数据中异质性模式。\"\n      - \"Fig 9: Education 维度的 CATE 估计比较——forest plot 样式，展示各方法在两个 subgroup 上的点估计和 CI，EC-HTE 覆盖 true value 而 global correction 偏移严重。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Real-data 实验验证了合成/semi-synthetic 发现在真实场景中的外部效度。Education 维度的 6.7x\n      amplification 尤其有说服力——这是一个政策相关的 CATE 差异（教育干预对低教育群体的效果），\n      global correction 不仅无法纠正 bias 反而将 CATE 估计推向负值（暗示干预有害），\n      这在政策决策中可能造成严重后果。该结果为论文提供了\"stakes are real\"的叙事素材。\n      Coverage 的 65%/58% 在 global correction 下表明不仅点估计有 bias，CI 也严重 miscalibrated。\n\n  - name: \"Diagnostic criterion ROC validation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-005\"\n    description: >\n      从 exp-001/exp-003/exp-004 所有实验设置中提取 (Δπ, Δτ) 对和对应的\"global correction 是否有害\"\n      binary label（定义为 bias_global > bias_nocorrection），计算 Δπ×Δτ product 作为 diagnostic score，\n      进行 ROC 分析。验证 Claim 3（diagnostic criterion）。\n    expected_results:\n      diagnostic_auc: 0.953\n      optimal_threshold_product: 0.008\n      sensitivity_at_optimal: 0.93\n      specificity_at_optimal: 0.88\n      ppv_at_optimal: 0.91\n      npv_at_optimal: 0.90\n      auc_synthetic_only: 0.971\n      auc_semisynthetic_only: 0.938\n      auc_realdata_only: 0.929\n      n_settings_evaluated: 342\n      n_positive_cases: 187  # global correction harmful\n      n_negative_cases: 155  # global correction not harmful\n    result_rationale: >\n      Diagnostic AUC 0.953 的来源：Δπ×Δτ product 是 bias 的一阶充分统计量（exp-002 已证明 R²≈0.98），\n      而\"global correction 有害\"本质上是\"bias > threshold\"的决策问题。一阶统计量作为 classifier\n      天然具有高 discriminative power。AUC 未达 1.0 因为：(1) sample size、base rate 等二阶因素\n      影响 bias 幅度但未被 product 捕捉；(2) 阈值定义的边界情况（amplification ≈ 1x）无法被\n      任何单一统计量完美分类。Synthetic-only AUC 最高因为 DGP 完全受控，semi-synthetic 次之因为\n      注入了已知 CATE 结构，real-data 最低因为 ground truth CATE 有估计误差。\n      Optimal threshold 0.008 意味着即使轻度异质性（如 Δπ=0.04, Δτ=0.20）也建议使用 stratified correction。\n      这支持论文的\"conservative\"建议：除非确认 homogeneity，否则默认使用 EC-HTE。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 12: Diagnostic criterion ROC analysis\"\n        columns: [\"data_source\", \"n_settings\", \"AUC\", \"optimal_threshold\", \"sensitivity\", \"specificity\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Synthetic (exp-001/002)\", 240, 0.971, 0.007, 0.95, 0.92]\n          - [\"Semi-synthetic (exp-003)\", 72, 0.938, 0.009, 0.91, 0.86]\n          - [\"Real data (exp-004)\", 30, 0.929, 0.010, 0.90, 0.83]\n          - [\"Combined\", 342, 0.953, 0.008, 0.93, 0.88]\n      - title: \"Table 13: Confusion matrix at optimal threshold (combined)\"\n        columns: [\"\", \"Predicted: use stratified\", \"Predicted: global OK\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Actual: global harmful\", 174, 13]\n          - [\"Actual: global OK\", 19, 136]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 10: ROC 曲线，三条线对应 synthetic/semi-synthetic/real-data，加 combined。AUC 值标注在图例中。对角虚线。\"\n      - \"Fig 11: Calibration scatter plot，x 轴 Δπ×Δτ product，y 轴 actual bias amplification factor，颜色编码 data source。展示 product 与 amplification 的单调关系，垂直虚线标注 optimal threshold。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Diagnostic criterion 的高 AUC（0.953）赋予它独立的实用价值——研究者可在不实施 EC-HTE 的情况下，\n      仅通过 pilot study 估计 Δπ 和 Δτ 来判断是否需要 stratified correction。这降低了方法的采用门槛。\n      Threshold 0.008 相对保守，意味着对多数实际场景建议 stratified correction，与 HB partial pooling\n      的\"never worse\"性质一致——即使不需要时使用 EC-HTE 也仅有微小效率损失。\n\n  - name: \"Expert label budget sensitivity sweep\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-006\"\n    description: >\n      系统性 budget sweep：n_expert ∈ {50, 100, 250, 500, 1000, 2000} × K ∈ {2, 4, 8} subgroups，\n      在 extreme regime 下。找到 EC-HTE 优于 Global correction 的 crossover point。\n      验证 HB partial pooling 在极小样本下的稳健性。\n    expected_results:\n      crossover_n_k2: 85  # n_expert at which EC-HTE first beats Global\n      crossover_n_k4: 140\n      crossover_n_k8: 210\n      ec_hte_rmse_at_n50_k2: 0.031\n      global_rmse_at_n50_k2: 0.042\n      ec_hte_still_better_at_n50_k2: true\n      ec_hte_rmse_at_n50_k8: 0.058  # K=8 时 50 labels 不够\n      global_rmse_at_n50_k8: 0.042\n      ec_hte_worse_at_n50_k8: true  # 此时 EC-HTE 反而更差\n      hb_vs_mle_rmse_ratio_at_n50_k4: 0.61  # HB 比 MLE 好 39%\n      hb_vs_mle_rmse_ratio_at_n100_k4: 0.69\n      hb_vs_mle_rmse_ratio_at_n250_k4: 0.78\n      hb_vs_mle_rmse_ratio_at_n2000_k4: 0.96\n      coverage_hb_at_n50_k2: 0.91\n      coverage_hb_at_n50_k8: 0.84  # undercoverage at extreme budget constraint\n    result_rationale: >\n      Crossover point 在 K=2 时约 n=85 因为：每 subgroup ~42 个 labels 足以让 HB Dirichlet 估计\n      的 confusion matrix 优于 pooled matrix 的 systematic bias。K=4 时 crossover 上升到 ~140\n      （每 subgroup ~35 labels），K=8 时 ~210（每 subgroup ~26 labels）。在 K=8, n=50 时\n      （每 subgroup 仅 ~6 labels）HB 估计方差过大，EC-HTE 反而不如 global——这是合理的，\n      反映了 bias-variance tradeoff 的基本限制。但这不削弱论文结论，因为 K=8 × n=50 是极端设定，\n      实践中 K=2-4 且 n≥250 是常见配置。HB 相对 MLE 的优势在 K=4 × n=50 时最显著（39% RMSE reduction），\n      因为每 subgroup 仅 ~12 labels，MLE 方差爆炸而 HB 有效收缩。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 14: Crossover analysis (extreme regime, K=2)\"\n        columns: [\"n_expert\", \"n_per_subgroup\", \"EC-HTE_RMSE\", \"Global_RMSE\", \"EC-HTE_better\"]\n        rows:\n          - [50, 25, 0.031, 0.042, \"✓\"]\n          - [100, 50, 0.022, 0.042, \"✓\"]\n          - [250, 125, 0.015, 0.042, \"✓\"]\n          - [500, 250, 0.011, 0.042, \"✓\"]\n          - [1000, 500, 0.008, 0.042, \"✓\"]\n          - [2000, 1000, 0.006, 0.042, \"✓\"]\n      - title: \"Table 15: Budget crossover by K\"\n        columns: [\"K\", \"crossover_n\", \"n_per_subgroup_at_crossover\", \"EC-HTE_RMSE_at_crossover\", \"Global_RMSE\"]\n        rows:\n          - [2, 85, 42, 0.041, 0.042]\n          - [4, 140, 35, 0.041, 0.042]\n          - [8, 210, 26, 0.041, 0.042]\n      - title: \"Table 16: K=8 failure mode\"\n        columns: [\"n_expert\", \"n_per_subgroup\", \"HB_RMSE\", \"MLE_RMSE\", \"Global_RMSE\", \"HB_coverage\"]\n        rows:\n          - [50, 6, 0.058, 0.093, 0.042, 0.84]\n          - [100, 12, 0.039, 0.061, 0.042, 0.90]\n          - [250, 31, 0.025, 0.034, 0.042, 0.94]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 12: Budget crossover curves——x 轴 n_expert (log scale)，y 轴 RMSE，每个 K 值一组 EC-HTE vs Global 交叉曲线。Global 水平线因为它不使用 subgroup-specific labels。交叉点标注。\"\n      - \"Fig 13: HB vs MLE RMSE ratio heatmap，x 轴 n_expert，y 轴 K，颜色深浅表示 HB 优势程度。左上角（小 n，大 K）HB 优势最大。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Budget sensitivity 分析给出实用建议：对典型设置（K=2-4），250 个 expert labels 即足够；\n      K=8 时需要至少 ~210 labels。在 K=8 × n=50 的极端情况下 EC-HTE 劣于 Global，\n      但这是 honest limitation 不是缺陷——论文应在 robustness section 报告并建议\n      n_expert ≥ 30K 作为使用 EC-HTE 的经验法则。HB partial pooling 在所有 K 下都优于 MLE，\n      且优势随 K 增大而增大——直接支撑 HB 选择的 motivation。\n\n  - name: \"PPCI baseline comparison and orthogonality demonstration\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-007\"\n    description: >\n      实现 PPCI（Sui et al., 2026）kernel-based conditional correction，与 EC-HTE 在相同 benchmark 上对比。\n      设计三种 error scenarios：(a) covariate-side only（LLM effect modifier 有误），\n      (b) outcome-side only（outcome measurement 有误），(c) both。验证 EC-HTE 和 PPCI 的正交性，\n      并尝试 composition（EC-HTE + PPCI 联合校正）。\n    expected_results:\n      # Scenario A: covariate-side error only\n      ppci_bias_covariate_error: 0.089  # PPCI 对 covariate-side error 无效\n      ec_hte_bias_covariate_error: 0.005\n      global_bias_covariate_error: 0.043\n      nocorrection_bias_covariate_error: 0.021\n      ppci_relative_bias_covariate: 0.93  # |bias|/|true_cate|，PPCI 几乎不改善\n      # Scenario B: outcome-side error only\n      ppci_bias_outcome_error: 0.004\n      ec_hte_bias_outcome_error: 0.018  # EC-HTE 对 outcome-side error 无效\n      global_bias_outcome_error: 0.019\n      nocorrection_bias_outcome_error: 0.020\n      # Scenario C: both errors\n      ppci_bias_both_errors: 0.082\n      ec_hte_bias_both_errors: 0.017\n      composition_bias_both_errors: 0.006  # EC-HTE + PPCI composition\n      nocorrection_bias_both_errors: 0.038\n      # Orthogonality metrics\n      ec_hte_ppci_correlation: 0.04  # near-zero correlation of correction terms\n      composition_improvement_over_best_single: 0.65  # in scenario C, composition bias / min(ec_hte, ppci) bias\n    result_rationale: >\n      PPCI 设计用于校正 outcome-side measurement error 对 conditional functionals 的影响，\n      通过 kernel 局部化实现条件校正。当 error 来自 covariate-side（effect modifier misclassification），\n      PPCI 的 kernel 无法定位到正确的 conditioning point——它试图在 mislabeled 的 X 空间中做局部校正，\n      但问题根源是 X 本身被错误分配。因此 PPCI bias 在 scenario A 中几乎不减少（relative bias 0.93）。\n      反过来，EC-HTE 仅校正 confusion matrix 引入的 covariate misclassification，对 outcome noise\n      不作处理，因此在 scenario B 中无效。这种正交性意味着在 scenario C（两种 error 同时存在）中，\n      composition（先 EC-HTE 校正 covariate-side，再 PPCI 校正 outcome-side）可将 bias 降至 0.006，\n      远优于任一单独方法。Correction terms 的近零相关性（r=0.04）进一步确认正交性。\n      这个结果干净地回答了 reviewer concern #2，且 composition 结果超越了\"仅证明不同\"的防守定位，\n      给出了\"可以组合\"的积极贡献。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 17: Head-to-head comparison across error scenarios\"\n        columns: [\"scenario\", \"method\", \"mean_abs_bias\", \"RMSE\", \"coverage_95\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"A: covariate-side\", \"No correction\", 0.021, 0.027, 0.87]\n          - [\"A: covariate-side\", \"Global correction\", 0.043, 0.048, 0.72]\n          - [\"A: covariate-side\", \"PPCI\", 0.089, 0.094, 0.58]\n          - [\"A: covariate-side\", \"EC-HTE\", 0.005, 0.012, 0.94]\n          - [\"B: outcome-side\", \"No correction\", 0.020, 0.025, 0.88]\n          - [\"B: outcome-side\", \"Global correction\", 0.019, 0.024, 0.88]\n          - [\"B: outcome-side\", \"PPCI\", 0.004, 0.010, 0.95]\n          - [\"B: outcome-side\", \"EC-HTE\", 0.018, 0.023, 0.89]\n          - [\"C: both\", \"No correction\", 0.038, 0.044, 0.82]\n          - [\"C: both\", \"Global correction\", 0.057, 0.063, 0.68]\n          - [\"C: both\", \"PPCI\", 0.082, 0.088, 0.61]\n          - [\"C: both\", \"EC-HTE\", 0.017, 0.023, 0.89]\n          - [\"C: both\", \"EC-HTE + PPCI\", 0.006, 0.012, 0.94]\n      - title: \"Table 18: Orthogonality evidence\"\n        columns: [\"metric\", \"value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Correlation of EC-HTE and PPCI correction terms\", 0.04]\n          - [\"EC-HTE bias reduction in scenario A\", \"76%\"]\n          - [\"EC-HTE bias reduction in scenario B\", \"10%\"]\n          - [\"PPCI bias reduction in scenario A\", \"-324%\"]\n          - [\"PPCI bias reduction in scenario B\", \"80%\"]\n          - [\"Composition bias reduction in scenario C (vs no correction)\", \"84%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 14: 2×3 panel plot，行=method（EC-HTE / PPCI），列=scenario（A/B/C），每个 panel 展示 subgroup-level bias bar chart。清晰可视化各方法在其'on-target'和'off-target'scenario 下的表现差异。\"\n      - \"Fig 15: Scenario C 的 sequential correction 示意图——原始 bias → EC-HTE 校正后 → EC-HTE+PPCI 校正后，waterfall chart 展示两步 correction 的累积效果。\"\n    analysis: >\n      PPCI 在 covariate-side error scenario 下不仅无效，反而因为在错误的 conditioning space 中做\n      kernel 局部化而恶化 bias（从 0.021 增至 0.089）——这是本实验最重要的发现，比预期更强。\n      正交性论证无懈可击：(1) theoretical——两个方法校正不同类型的 error；(2) empirical——correction terms\n      近零相关；(3) constructive——composition 在 scenario C 中给出最优结果。\n      这将 reviewer concern #2 从\"我们不同于 PPCI\"升级为\"我们与 PPCI 互补\"，是正面贡献而非防守性解释。\n      Note: PPCI 在 scenario A 中恶化 bias 不应被解读为 PPCI 有缺陷——它本就不设计用于 covariate-side error。\n      论文应 frame 为\"applying the wrong correction is worse than no correction\"，这恰好也是\n      我们对 global correction 的核心论点。\n\n  - name: \"Multiple LLM annotator comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-008\"\n    description: >\n      在 semi-synthetic benchmark（exp-003 同一数据集）上比较 GPT-4.1、Qwen3-235B-A22B、\n      Claude Sonnet 4.6 三个 LLM 的标注质量和 EC-HTE 收益。测量 misclassification heterogeneity\n      模式差异，验证 EC-HTE benefit 随 LLM 质量变化。\n    expected_results:\n      gpt4_accuracy: 0.87\n      qwen3_accuracy: 0.82\n      claude_sonnet_accuracy: 0.89\n      gpt4_error_heterogeneity_delta_pi: 0.15\n      qwen3_error_heterogeneity_delta_pi: 0.17\n      claude_sonnet_error_heterogeneity_delta_pi: 0.11\n      ec_hte_improvement_gpt4: 0.89  # bias reduction fraction\n      ec_hte_improvement_qwen3: 0.92\n      ec_hte_improvement_claude: 0.85\n      global_amplification_gpt4: 5.4\n      global_amplification_qwen3: 6.9\n      global_amplification_claude: 4.1\n      error_pattern_correlation_gpt4_qwen3: 0.72\n      error_pattern_correlation_gpt4_claude: 0.68\n      error_pattern_correlation_qwen3_claude: 0.74\n    result_rationale: >\n      Claude Sonnet 4.6 总体准确率最高（0.89）但仍有显著 subgroup 异质性（Δπ=0.11），\n      因为异质性的根源（不同 subgroup 在预训练数据中的表达频率差异）在所有 LLM 中结构相似。\n      Qwen3 异质性最大因为中文中心预训练导致英文政治语料的 subgroup 差异被放大。\n      EC-HTE improvement 与异质性正相关（Qwen3 最高 0.92，Claude 最低 0.85），符合理论预测。\n      三个 LLM 的 error pattern 有中等相关（0.68-0.74），反映共同的\"低资源 subgroup 更难\"模式，\n      但具体 error 分布不同——这建议如果使用多 LLM ensemble，应对每个 LLM 独立估计 confusion matrix。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 19: LLM comparison summary\"\n        columns: [\"LLM\", \"accuracy\", \"Δπ\", \"bias_amplification_global\", \"ec_hte_bias_reduction\", \"ec_hte_RMSE\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GPT-4.1\", 0.87, 0.15, \"5.4x\", \"89%\", 0.014]\n          - [\"Qwen3-235B-A22B\", 0.82, 0.17, \"6.9x\", \"92%\", 0.016]\n          - [\"Claude Sonnet 4.6\", 0.89, 0.11, \"4.1x\", \"85%\", 0.012]\n      - title: \"Table 20: Cross-LLM error pattern correlations\"\n        columns: [\"\", \"GPT-4.1\", \"Qwen3\", \"Claude Sonnet\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GPT-4.1\", \"1.00\", \"0.72\", \"0.68\"]\n          - [\"Qwen3\", \"0.72\", \"1.00\", \"0.74\"]\n          - [\"Claude Sonnet\", \"0.68\", \"0.74\", \"1.00\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A1 (appendix): 三 LLM 的 subgroup-specific error rate parallel coordinates plot，每条线是一个 subgroup，x 轴三个 LLM，y 轴 error rate。展示 subgroup 排序在 LLM 间大致一致但幅度不同。\"\n    analysis: >\n      关键发现：即使最准确的 LLM（Claude Sonnet 4.6, acc=0.89）仍产生 4.1x bias amplification under\n      global correction，且 EC-HTE 带来 85% bias reduction。这说明问题不会随 LLM 进步自动消失——\n      只要存在 subgroup heterogeneity（哪怕较小），global correction 就有害。\n      该实验适合放 appendix，作为 generalizability evidence。\n\n  - name: \"Adaptive expert annotation allocation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-009\"\n    description: >\n      实现 CATE-weighted adaptive allocation：将 expert label budget 不均匀分配至 subgroups，\n      优先标注 high-CATE × high-error subgroups。比较 uniform、uncertainty-only、CATE-weighted 三种策略。\n    expected_results:\n      uniform_rmse_at_n250_k4: 0.027\n      uncertainty_only_rmse_at_n250_k4: 0.023\n      cate_weighted_rmse_at_n250_k4: 0.020\n      cate_weighted_improvement_vs_uniform: 0.26  # 26% RMSE reduction\n      cate_weighted_improvement_vs_uncertainty: 0.13\n      uniform_allocation_per_subgroup: [62, 63, 62, 63]\n      cate_weighted_allocation_per_subgroup: [95, 75, 50, 30]  # high-CATE×high-error first\n      efficiency_gain_equivalent_n: 340  # uniform needs n=340 to match CATE-weighted at n=250\n    result_rationale: >\n      CATE-weighted allocation 优于 uniform 因为 EC-HTE 的 estimation error 不是在各 subgroup 上\n      均匀分布的——high-CATE subgroup 的 confusion matrix 估计误差对总 RMSE 的贡献与 τ_k² 成正比\n      （通过 error propagation）。同时 high-error subgroup 的 confusion matrix 需要更多 labels\n      才能达到同等精度。CATE-weighted 策略同时优化这两个维度。Uncertainty-only 策略仅关注 confusion matrix\n      估计不确定性，忽略 CATE 权重，因此次优。效率增益等价于 n=340 的 uniform allocation，\n      即 CATE-weighted 用 250 labels 达到 uniform 340 labels 的效果。\n      这是 P2 实验，放 appendix，作为 practical extension。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table A1: Allocation strategy comparison (K=4, extreme regime)\"\n        columns: [\"strategy\", \"n_total\", \"allocation\", \"RMSE\", \"coverage\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Uniform\", 250, \"[62,63,62,63]\", 0.027, 0.940]\n          - [\"Uncertainty-only\", 250, \"[78,72,55,45]\", 0.023, 0.945]\n          - [\"CATE-weighted\", 250, \"[95,75,50,30]\", 0.020, 0.948]\n          - [\"Uniform (matched)\", 340, \"[85,85,85,85]\", 0.020, 0.949]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A2: Allocation strategy comparison bar chart，三种策略的 RMSE 和 efficiency-equivalent n。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Adaptive allocation 是自然的 practical extension，但 RMSE improvement 适中（26% vs uniform），\n      且增加实现复杂度（需要 CATE 的初步估计来指导 allocation）。适合 appendix 作为 future direction\n      而非主实验。论文可提一句\"with adaptive allocation, budget requirements drop further\"。\n\n  - name: \"Robustness to misspecified subgroup structure\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-010\"\n    description: >\n      测试 EC-HTE 在 subgroup 结构 misspecified 时的表现：(a) 使用 coarsened subgroups（真实 K=4，\n      model 用 K=2），(b) 使用 noisy subgroup assignment（10-30% subgroup label noise），\n      (c) continuous heterogeneity（Δπ 连续变化但 model 用 discrete bins）。\n    expected_results:\n      # (a) Coarsened subgroups\n      coarsened_ec_hte_rmse: 0.019  # vs oracle K=4 的 0.014\n      coarsened_ec_hte_bias: 0.008  # 有 residual bias 因为 within-merged-group heterogeneity\n      coarsened_global_rmse: 0.042  # global 不受影响\n      coarsened_ec_hte_still_better: true\n      # (b) Noisy subgroup assignment\n      noise_10pct_ec_hte_rmse: 0.016\n      noise_20pct_ec_hte_rmse: 0.021\n      noise_30pct_ec_hte_rmse: 0.028\n      noise_30pct_global_rmse: 0.042\n      noise_breakeven_pct: 0.38  # EC-HTE = Global at ~38% noise\n      # (c) Continuous heterogeneity\n      continuous_binned_k2_rmse: 0.022\n      continuous_binned_k4_rmse: 0.017\n      continuous_binned_k8_rmse: 0.015\n      continuous_global_rmse: 0.042\n    result_rationale: >\n      HB partial pooling 提供对 misspecification 的自然鲁棒性：(a) 当 subgroups 过粗时，\n      merged group 内仍有 residual heterogeneity，但 EC-HTE 的 bias（0.008）仍远小于 global（0.043），\n      因为即使粗化的 stratification 也捕获了大部分跨组差异。(b) Noisy subgroup assignment\n      导致 confusion matrix 估计被污染（cross-contamination），RMSE 随 noise 线性增长，\n      但由于 HB shrinkage 的稳定性，即使 30% noise 下 EC-HTE（0.028）仍优于 global（0.042），\n      breakeven 在约 38% noise——远超实际场景中可能的 subgroup misclassification level。\n      (c) Continuous heterogeneity 下 discretization 是一种 approximation error，更细的 binning\n      更好但受 per-bin sample size 限制；K=4 是 good default，K=8 marginal improvement 不值 cost。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table A2: Robustness analysis summary\"\n        columns: [\"scenario\", \"EC-HTE_RMSE\", \"Global_RMSE\", \"EC-HTE_still_better\", \"degradation_vs_oracle\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Oracle (K=4, no noise)\", 0.014, 0.042, \"✓\", \"baseline\"]\n          - [\"Coarsened (K=2)\", 0.019, 0.042, \"✓\", \"+36%\"]\n          - [\"Noise 10%\", 0.016, 0.042, \"✓\", \"+14%\"]\n          - [\"Noise 20%\", 0.021, 0.042, \"✓\", \"+50%\"]\n          - [\"Noise 30%\", 0.028, 0.042, \"✓\", \"+100%\"]\n          - [\"Noise 38%\", 0.042, 0.042, \"—\", \"breakeven\"]\n          - [\"Continuous, K=4 bins\", 0.017, 0.042, \"✓\", \"+21%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A3: RMSE vs subgroup noise level 折线图，EC-HTE 上升曲线 vs Global 水平线，交叉点标注 breakeven。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Robustness 分析的核心结论：EC-HTE 在相当宽的 misspecification 范围内保持优势，\n      breakeven noise level（38%）远超实际场景。这直接回应 reviewer concern #4。\n      HB partial pooling 是关键——当 subgroup 结构 noisy 时，HB 自动向 global 收缩，\n      限制了 misspecification 的损害。该实验适合 appendix。\n\n  - name: \"Causal forest integration\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-011\"\n    description: >\n      将 EC-HTE 与 CausalForestDML 集成：(a) post-hoc correction——先用 LLM labels 训练 causal forest\n      得到 subgroup CATE，再用 EC-HTE 校正；(b) corrected pseudo-outcomes——用 EC-HTE 校正后的\n      pseudo-outcomes 重新训练 causal forest，with variance-adjusted CIs。\n      比较 naive forest、globally-corrected forest、EC-HTE corrected forest。\n    expected_results:\n      naive_forest_subgroup_bias: 0.024\n      global_corrected_forest_subgroup_bias: 0.051\n      ec_hte_posthoc_forest_bias: 0.007\n      ec_hte_pseudooutcome_forest_bias: 0.005\n      naive_forest_coverage: 0.88\n      global_corrected_forest_coverage: 0.73\n      ec_hte_posthoc_forest_coverage: 0.93\n      ec_hte_pseudooutcome_forest_coverage: 0.95\n      naive_forest_rmse: 0.029\n      ec_hte_posthoc_forest_rmse: 0.015\n      ec_hte_pseudooutcome_forest_rmse: 0.013\n      cate_heterogeneity_detection_power_naive: 0.62\n      cate_heterogeneity_detection_power_ec_hte: 0.89\n    result_rationale: >\n      Naive causal forest 继承 LLM label noise 作为 covariate measurement error，导致 CATE 估计\n      有 attenuation bias。Global correction 将 correction 均匀应用于所有 leaf nodes，\n      但不同 leaf 的 subgroup composition 不同，因此产生与 subgroup-level 分析相同的 over/under-correction。\n      EC-HTE post-hoc correction 在 forest 训练后按 subgroup 调整，消除 systematic bias 但\n      不能修正 forest 本身因 noisy covariates 导致的 split quality degradation。\n      EC-HTE pseudo-outcome approach 更优因为在 forest 训练前就校正了 pseudo-outcomes，\n      使 forest 在 cleaner data 上学习，同时 variance adjustment 使 CI 正确反映 confusion matrix 不确定性。\n      Heterogeneity detection power 从 0.62 提升至 0.89 是因为 bias 的 removal 使得真实的 CATE\n      heterogeneity signal 不再被 noise-induced 的 spurious heterogeneity 混淆。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 21: Causal forest integration comparison\"\n        columns: [\"method\", \"subgroup_bias\", \"RMSE\", \"coverage_95\", \"het_detection_power\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Naive CausalForest\", 0.024, 0.029, 0.88, 0.62]\n          - [\"Global-corrected CausalForest\", 0.051, 0.056, 0.73, 0.55]\n          - [\"EC-HTE post-hoc CausalForest\", 0.007, 0.015, 0.93, 0.85]\n          - [\"EC-HTE pseudo-outcome CausalForest\", 0.005, 0.013, 0.95, 0.89]\n          - [\"Oracle CausalForest (true labels)\", 0.002, 0.010, 0.95, 0.93]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 16: CATE estimate scatter plot，four methods，x 轴 true CATE，y 轴 estimated CATE。Naive 和 global 偏离 45° 线，EC-HTE 两种方式紧贴。\"\n      - \"Fig 17: Heterogeneity detection ROC curves——naive forest 的低 power 表明它无法可靠区分真实 heterogeneity 和 noise-induced variation，EC-HTE correction 恢复 detection ability。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Causal forest integration 证明 EC-HTE 不限于 simple difference-in-means CATE estimator，\n      可与现代 ML-based CATE 方法无缝集成。Pseudo-outcome approach 接近 oracle performance\n      （bias 0.005 vs 0.002），仅有 confusion matrix 估计噪声的 residual gap。\n      Global correction 在 forest 中同样有害（bias 从 0.024 恶化至 0.051），与 subgroup-level\n      分析一致——进一步强化 paper 的核心 message。\n      Heterogeneity detection power 的提升（0.62→0.89）有重要实际意义：\n      它意味着 EC-HTE 不仅改善 point estimation，还改善了\"发现 heterogeneity\"的 statistical power。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10103,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10103},"output_tokens":26,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d3e925fc-24dd-4c87-b2ac-ec185e0a37c4","uuid":"3027a2ff-f934-417b-bfde-b640cc78a48b"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":342403,"duration_api_ms":343587,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 完全成立。论文以 problem-discovery 定位：首次识别并形式化 measurement-error × causal-heterogeneity\n  confounding，Δπ×Δτ product 诊断准则有独立实用价值。Headline result 可直接使用（\"global correction\n  worsens bias by up to 7.8x\"）。PPCI 正交性干净，K>2 扩展自然，HB partial pooling 在小样本下优势显著。\n  论文结构 Theory → Synthetic → Semi-synthetic → Real data 全链条闭合，无需防守性让步。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Hierarchical Bayesian EC-HTE synthetic validation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-001\"\n    description: >\n      在合成数据上实现 HB Dirichlet-prior confusion matrix estimator，与 MLE stratified 和 Laplace smoothed\n      基线对比。覆盖 extreme/moderate/homogeneous error regimes × n_expert ∈ {100,250,500,1000,2000}\n      × K ∈ {2,4} subgroups，共 1000 次 MC 重复。PyMC NUTS sampler，4 chains，warmup=1000。\n    expected_results:\n      hb_rmse_vs_mle_at_n100_k2: 0.72  # HB RMSE / MLE RMSE，即 28% reduction\n      hb_rmse_vs_mle_at_n250_k2: 0.74  # 26% reduction\n      hb_rmse_vs_mle_at_n250_k4: 0.68  # 32% reduction，K=4 时 MLE 方差膨胀更严重\n      hb_rmse_vs_mle_at_n1000_k2: 0.91  # 大样本下 HB 收缩减弱，优势缩小\n      hb_rmse_vs_mle_at_n2000_k2: 0.96  # 几乎无差异\n      hb_coverage_95ci_extreme_n250: 0.943\n      hb_coverage_95ci_moderate_n250: 0.951\n      hb_coverage_95ci_homogeneous_n250: 0.954\n      mle_coverage_95ci_extreme_n250: 0.87  # MLE 小样本下严重 undercoverage\n      laplace_coverage_95ci_extreme_n250: 0.91\n      ec_hte_subgroup_bias_extreme: 0.003  # 近零 bias（绝对值）\n      global_correction_subgroup_bias_extreme: 0.041  # 显著 bias\n      rhat_max: 1.004\n      ess_min: 387\n      mcmc_runtime_per_fit_seconds: 2.3\n      mle_runtime_per_fit_seconds: 0.008\n      mc_runs: 1000\n    result_rationale: >\n      HB Dirichlet partial pooling 在小样本下的优势来自两个机制：(1) 当 n_expert ≤ 250 时，per-subgroup\n      confusion matrix 的 MLE 估计面临严重的有限样本方差——K=4 时每个 subgroup 仅 ~62 个标注，2×2 矩阵\n      4 个参数的 MLE 方差很大，矩阵求逆进一步放大误差；HB 通过向全局先验收缩，借用跨 subgroup 信息，\n      有效降低估计方差。(2) Coverage 改善因为 HB 的后验区间自然包含参数不确定性，而 MLE 的 delta-method CI\n      在小样本下低估方差。随着 n_expert → 2000，每个 subgroup 有充足数据，MLE 渐近最优性使 HB 优势消失。\n      Extreme regime 下 HB 优势最大，因为 subgroup 间 error rate 差异大（π₁=0.15 vs π₂=0.35），\n      MLE 在低频 subgroup 上方差爆炸。MCMC 收敛良好因为 Dirichlet-Multinomial 是共轭结构，\n      posterior geometry 简单，NUTS 无困难。Runtime 比 MLE 慢 ~300x 但绝对值仍可接受。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 1: RMSE comparison across methods, regimes, and sample sizes (K=2)\"\n        columns: [\"regime\", \"n_expert\", \"MLE_RMSE\", \"Laplace_RMSE\", \"HB_RMSE\", \"HB/MLE_ratio\", \"HB_95CI_coverage\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"extreme\", 100, 0.058, 0.049, 0.042, 0.72, 0.932]\n          - [\"extreme\", 250, 0.037, 0.032, 0.027, 0.74, 0.943]\n          - [\"extreme\", 500, 0.024, 0.022, 0.020, 0.83, 0.948]\n          - [\"extreme\", 1000, 0.016, 0.015, 0.015, 0.91, 0.952]\n          - [\"extreme\", 2000, 0.011, 0.011, 0.011, 0.96, 0.953]\n          - [\"moderate\", 100, 0.041, 0.036, 0.031, 0.76, 0.938]\n          - [\"moderate\", 250, 0.027, 0.024, 0.021, 0.78, 0.951]\n          - [\"moderate\", 500, 0.018, 0.017, 0.016, 0.87, 0.953]\n          - [\"moderate\", 1000, 0.012, 0.012, 0.011, 0.93, 0.954]\n          - [\"moderate\", 2000, 0.009, 0.009, 0.008, 0.97, 0.953]\n          - [\"homogeneous\", 100, 0.032, 0.029, 0.027, 0.84, 0.944]\n          - [\"homogeneous\", 250, 0.021, 0.020, 0.019, 0.88, 0.954]\n          - [\"homogeneous\", 500, 0.015, 0.014, 0.014, 0.93, 0.955]\n          - [\"homogeneous\", 1000, 0.010, 0.010, 0.010, 0.97, 0.954]\n          - [\"homogeneous\", 2000, 0.007, 0.007, 0.007, 0.99, 0.953]\n      - title: \"Table 2: K=4 subgroups results (extreme regime)\"\n        columns: [\"n_expert\", \"MLE_RMSE\", \"HB_RMSE\", \"HB/MLE_ratio\", \"HB_coverage\", \"MLE_coverage\"]\n        rows:\n          - [100, 0.089, 0.058, 0.65, 0.921, 0.82]\n          - [250, 0.054, 0.037, 0.68, 0.940, 0.86]\n          - [500, 0.035, 0.027, 0.77, 0.949, 0.91]\n          - [1000, 0.023, 0.020, 0.87, 0.953, 0.94]\n          - [2000, 0.016, 0.015, 0.94, 0.954, 0.95]\n      - title: \"Table 3: MCMC diagnostics summary\"\n        columns: [\"metric\", \"min\", \"median\", \"max\", \"threshold\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"R̂\", 1.000, 1.001, 1.004, \"<1.01\"]\n          - [\"ESS (bulk)\", 387, 1240, 4000, \">200\"]\n          - [\"ESS (tail)\", 302, 980, 3500, \">200\"]\n          - [\"divergences\", 0, 0, 0, \"0\"]\n          - [\"runtime (s)\", 1.1, 2.3, 4.7, \"-\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 1a: HB/MLE RMSE ratio vs n_expert 折线图，三条线对应 extreme/moderate/homogeneous regimes，K=2。展示 HB 优势随 n 增大而收敛至 1.0 的渐近行为。\"\n      - \"Fig 1b: Coverage calibration plot，nominal 95% CI 下 HB/MLE/Laplace 三种方法的 empirical coverage vs n_expert。MLE 在小样本下系统性 undercoverage。\"\n      - \"Fig 1c: K=2 vs K=4 对比，HB/MLE ratio vs n_expert，展示 K=4 时 HB 优势更显著。\"\n    analysis: >\n      核心发现：HB partial pooling 在 n_expert ≤ 250 时提供 22-35% RMSE reduction（取决于 regime 和 K），\n      且 coverage 始终在 [0.92, 0.96] 范围内。K=4 时优势更显著，因为 per-subgroup 样本量减半导致 MLE\n      方差翻倍。这直接支撑 Claim 2 中\"partial pooling controls estimation variance\"的论断。\n      Homogeneous regime 下 HB 优势最小（收缩方向与真实值接近），但不会更差——验证\"never worse than global\"性质。\n      MCMC 诊断全部通过，无需担心计算可靠性。\n\n  - name: \"Formal bias bound verification with K>2 extension\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-002\"\n    description: >\n      解析推导 bias = Σ_k w_k · (π_global - π_k) · τ_k 的形式化表达，其中 π_k 是 subgroup k 的\n      misclassification rate，τ_k 是 subgroup CATE。K=2 时简化为 bias ∝ Δπ × Δτ。\n      在系统参数网格上（Δπ ∈ [0, 0.3], Δτ ∈ [0, 0.5], base rates 变化）进行 MC 验证。\n      K=4 扩展验证 sum-of-products 形式。\n    expected_results:\n      analytic_vs_mc_r_squared_k2: 0.982\n      analytic_vs_mc_r_squared_k4: 0.971\n      bound_tightness_ratio_median: 1.03  # analytic / empirical，接近 1 表示 tight\n      bound_tightness_ratio_95pct: 1.12\n      bias_amplification_max_observed: 7.8  # global correction bias / no correction bias\n      bias_amplification_mean_extreme: 6.2\n      bias_amplification_mean_moderate: 3.1  # moderate regime 下仍有显著放大但不到 5x\n      debiasing_hurts_fraction_extreme: 0.94  # extreme regime 下 94% 的 grid points global correction 更差\n      debiasing_hurts_fraction_moderate: 0.67\n      constructive_example_bias_nocorrection: 0.023\n      constructive_example_bias_global: 0.179  # 7.8x amplification\n      constructive_example_bias_ec_hte: 0.002\n      k4_sum_of_products_empirical_match: 0.97  # correlation between predicted and observed\n    result_rationale: >\n      解析 bound 与 MC 高度吻合（R² > 0.97）的原因：在 K=2 binary classification 下，bias 的 closed-form\n      表达 bias_global = (π̂_global - π₁)·τ₁·w₁ + (π̂_global - π₂)·τ₂·w₂ 是精确的，不依赖渐近近似。\n      π̂_global = w₁π₁ + w₂π₂ 代入后得到 bias ∝ w₁w₂·Δπ·Δτ 的乘积形式。MC 偏离仅来自有限样本\n      confusion matrix 估计噪声，随 MC 重复次数增多趋于零。R² 未达 1.0 是因为 base rate 和 sample size\n      引入的二阶效应。K=4 时 R² 略低因为 sum-of-products 形式有更多交叉项，但核心结构不变。\n      Bias amplification 7.8x 出现在 constructive example 中：π₁=0.10, π₂=0.35, τ₁=0.15, τ₂=0.02\n      ——low-error subgroup 有大 treatment effect，global correction 用 π̂_global≈0.22 严重过校正该 subgroup，\n      而 high-error subgroup 的 small τ₂ 意味着欠校正损害小。净效果：global correction 在 subgroup 1 引入\n      大 bias，远超 no correction 下的原始 bias。这是本文最核心的 insight。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 4: Analytic bound vs MC empirical bias (K=2, selected grid points)\"\n        columns: [\"Δπ\", \"Δτ\", \"bias_analytic\", \"bias_mc_mean\", \"bias_mc_se\", \"ratio\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0.05, 0.10, 0.006, 0.006, 0.001, 1.01]\n          - [0.10, 0.10, 0.013, 0.012, 0.001, 1.02]\n          - [0.10, 0.30, 0.038, 0.037, 0.002, 1.03]\n          - [0.20, 0.20, 0.050, 0.049, 0.002, 1.02]\n          - [0.20, 0.40, 0.100, 0.097, 0.003, 1.03]\n          - [0.25, 0.50, 0.156, 0.149, 0.004, 1.05]\n          - [0.30, 0.50, 0.188, 0.179, 0.005, 1.05]\n      - title: \"Table 5: Bias amplification factor (global/no-correction) by regime\"\n        columns: [\"regime\", \"Δπ\", \"Δτ\", \"bias_no_corr\", \"bias_global\", \"amplification\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"extreme\", 0.25, 0.13, 0.023, 0.179, \"7.8x\"]\n          - [\"extreme\", 0.20, 0.15, 0.019, 0.118, \"6.2x\"]\n          - [\"extreme\", 0.15, 0.20, 0.015, 0.080, \"5.3x\"]\n          - [\"moderate\", 0.10, 0.10, 0.008, 0.025, \"3.1x\"]\n          - [\"homogeneous\", 0.03, 0.05, 0.001, 0.002, \"1.5x\"]\n      - title: \"Table 6: K=4 sum-of-products verification\"\n        columns: [\"config\", \"bias_predicted\", \"bias_mc\", \"abs_error\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"balanced, linear Δπ\", 0.062, 0.060, 0.002]\n          - [\"balanced, quadratic Δπ\", 0.084, 0.081, 0.003]\n          - [\"unbalanced, linear Δπ\", 0.071, 0.068, 0.003]\n          - [\"unbalanced, quadratic Δπ\", 0.098, 0.093, 0.005]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 2: Bias amplification heatmap，x 轴 Δπ ∈ [0, 0.3]，y 轴 Δτ ∈ [0, 0.5]，颜色表示 amplification factor。清晰展示乘积结构：等高线近似双曲线 Δπ×Δτ = const。右上角深红（>7x），左下角白色（<2x）。Headline figure for paper.\"\n      - \"Fig 3: Constructive example bar chart，三组 bar（No correction / Global / EC-HTE）× 两个 subgroups，展示 global correction 如何在 low-error subgroup 引入巨大 bias 而 EC-HTE 消除之。\"\n      - \"Fig 4: K=4 scatter plot，analytic predicted bias vs MC observed bias，45° line，R²=0.971。\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是论文的理论基础实验。R² ≈ 0.98 证明 Δπ×Δτ product 形式不是近似而是（在 population 层面）精确的，\n      MC 偏离仅反映有限样本噪声。Bias amplification 最高 7.8x 出现在 extreme regime 的特定配置下，\n      这成为论文 headline number。K=4 扩展验证 sum-of-products Σ_k w_k(π̄-π_k)τ_k 形式同样成立，\n      R²=0.971 略低但仍远超阈值。这为 Remark 1（general-K case）提供实证支持。\n      关键洞察：amplification 在 Δπ 和 Δτ 都大时最严重，但即使中等水平（Δπ=0.10, Δτ=0.10）\n      也有 3.1x 放大，说明问题不限于极端情况。\n\n  - name: \"Semi-synthetic political-science benchmark\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-003\"\n    description: >\n      使用 CardiffNLP TweetEval sentiment/stance 子集或类似公开政治推文语料，注入已知 CATE 异质性结构\n      （如 economic framing 调节 campaign message 效果）。用 GPT-4.1 和 Qwen3-235B-A22B 标注 effect modifier，\n      测量 subgroup-specific misclassification rates，验证异质性存在。应用 EC-HTE vs Global vs No-correction\n      vs MLE-stratified baselines。N ≈ 20000 tweets, n_expert = 500 gold labels。\n    expected_results:\n      gpt4_overall_accuracy: 0.87\n      gpt4_subgroup_accuracy_high: 0.93\n      gpt4_subgroup_accuracy_low: 0.78\n      gpt4_max_min_error_ratio: 2.15  # (1-0.78)/(1-0.93) = 3.14，但以 misclass rate ratio 计\n      qwen3_overall_accuracy: 0.82\n      qwen3_subgroup_accuracy_high: 0.89\n      qwen3_subgroup_accuracy_low: 0.72\n      qwen3_max_min_error_ratio: 2.55\n      ec_hte_cate_bias_subgroup1_gpt4: 0.004\n      ec_hte_cate_bias_subgroup2_gpt4: 0.006\n      global_cate_bias_subgroup1_gpt4: 0.038\n      global_cate_bias_subgroup2_gpt4: -0.031\n      nocorrection_cate_bias_subgroup1_gpt4: 0.012\n      nocorrection_cate_bias_subgroup2_gpt4: -0.018\n      bias_amplification_global_gpt4: 5.4\n      bias_amplification_global_qwen3: 6.9\n      ec_hte_coverage_gpt4: 0.94\n      ec_hte_coverage_qwen3: 0.93\n      ec_hte_bias_reduction_vs_global_gpt4: 0.89  # 1 - ec_hte_bias/global_bias\n      ec_hte_bias_reduction_vs_global_qwen3: 0.92\n      subgroup_misclass_heterogeneity_gpt4: 0.15  # |π₁ - π₂|\n      subgroup_misclass_heterogeneity_qwen3: 0.17\n    result_rationale: >\n      GPT-4.1 在政治推文分类上总体准确率约 87%，但在不同 subgroup 上存在显著异质性：对主流经济议题\n      （high-resource subgroup）准确率 93%，对少数族裔/移民相关议题（low-resource subgroup）准确率仅 78%。\n      这种异质性来源于训练数据分布——主流议题在预训练语料中出现频率远高于边缘议题。Qwen3 作为非英语中心模型，\n      整体准确率略低但异质性模式类似。error ratio ≥ 1.5 的核心假设成立（实际 ratio 更高）。\n      Global correction 使用 π̂≈0.13（GPT-4.1）对所有 subgroup 校正：对 high-accuracy subgroup（真实 π=0.07）\n      过校正，对 low-accuracy subgroup（真实 π=0.22）欠校正，产生系统性 bias 在 subgroup 层面放大 5-7x。\n      EC-HTE 使用 stratified confusion matrix（由 500 expert labels 估计，HB pooling）正确校正各 subgroup，\n      residual bias 仅来自有限样本 confusion matrix 估计误差。Coverage 94% 因为 HB posterior CI\n      正确传播了 confusion matrix 不确定性。Qwen3 amplification 更高因为异质性更大。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 7: Subgroup-specific LLM misclassification rates\"\n        columns: [\"LLM\", \"subgroup\", \"n\", \"accuracy\", \"FPR\", \"FNR\", \"misclass_rate\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GPT-4.1\", \"economic-mainstream\", 11200, 0.93, 0.04, 0.10, 0.07]\n          - [\"GPT-4.1\", \"minority-immigration\", 8800, 0.78, 0.12, 0.31, 0.22]\n          - [\"GPT-4.1\", \"pooled\", 20000, 0.87, 0.07, 0.19, 0.13]\n          - [\"Qwen3-235B\", \"economic-mainstream\", 11200, 0.89, 0.06, 0.16, 0.11]\n          - [\"Qwen3-235B\", \"minority-immigration\", 8800, 0.72, 0.15, 0.40, 0.28]\n          - [\"Qwen3-235B\", \"pooled\", 20000, 0.82, 0.10, 0.26, 0.18]\n      - title: \"Table 8: CATE estimation comparison (GPT-4.1 annotations)\"\n        columns: [\"method\", \"subgroup\", \"CATE_true\", \"CATE_est\", \"bias\", \"RMSE\", \"coverage_95\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"No correction\", \"economic-mainstream\", 0.150, 0.138, -0.012, 0.018, 0.89]\n          - [\"No correction\", \"minority-immigration\", 0.040, 0.058, 0.018, 0.023, 0.85]\n          - [\"Global correction\", \"economic-mainstream\", 0.150, 0.188, 0.038, 0.042, 0.71]\n          - [\"Global correction\", \"minority-immigration\", 0.040, 0.009, -0.031, 0.035, 0.76]\n          - [\"MLE stratified\", \"economic-mainstream\", 0.150, 0.153, 0.003, 0.021, 0.91]\n          - [\"MLE stratified\", \"minority-immigration\", 0.040, 0.044, 0.004, 0.019, 0.90]\n          - [\"EC-HTE (HB)\", \"economic-mainstream\", 0.150, 0.154, 0.004, 0.014, 0.94]\n          - [\"EC-HTE (HB)\", \"minority-immigration\", 0.040, 0.046, 0.006, 0.012, 0.95]\n      - title: \"Table 9: Same comparison with Qwen3-235B\"\n        columns: [\"method\", \"subgroup\", \"CATE_true\", \"CATE_est\", \"bias\", \"RMSE\", \"coverage_95\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"No correction\", \"economic-mainstream\", 0.150, 0.133, -0.017, 0.023, 0.86]\n          - [\"No correction\", \"minority-immigration\", 0.040, 0.065, 0.025, 0.030, 0.81]\n          - [\"Global correction\", \"economic-mainstream\", 0.150, 0.201, 0.051, 0.055, 0.63]\n          - [\"Global correction\", \"minority-immigration\", 0.040, -0.003, -0.043, 0.048, 0.68]\n          - [\"EC-HTE (HB)\", \"economic-mainstream\", 0.150, 0.155, 0.005, 0.016, 0.93]\n          - [\"EC-HTE (HB)\", \"minority-immigration\", 0.040, 0.047, 0.007, 0.014, 0.93]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 5: Bias mechanism schematic——左侧展示 global correction 对两个 subgroup 的 over/under-correction 方向与幅度，右侧展示 EC-HTE stratified correction 消除 bias。Arrow diagram。\"\n      - \"Fig 6: Grouped bar chart，4 methods × 2 subgroups × 2 LLMs，y 轴为 |bias|，展示 global correction 在所有 subgroup 上 bias 最大。\"\n      - \"Fig 7: Coverage vs nominal level calibration plot，EC-HTE 点在对角线附近，Global 系统性低于对角线。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Semi-synthetic 实验是论文的核心实证。两个 LLM 在真实政治推文上确实展现显著的 subgroup 异质性\n      （error ratio 2.15x 和 2.55x，远超 1.5x 假设阈值），验证了问题的现实性。Global correction\n      不仅未改善 CATE 估计，反而使 bias 恶化 5-7x——这是论文最有力的 headline result。\n      EC-HTE 在两个 LLM 上都将 bias 降至近零（reduction 89-92%），coverage 维持在 93-95%，\n      同时 RMSE 也优于 MLE stratified（因 HB partial pooling 降低方差）。\n      GPT-4.1 结果好于 Qwen3 因为基础准确率更高，但即使对 GPT-4.1 这种高质量 LLM，\n      global correction 仍然有害——强化\"问题普遍存在\"的论点。\n\n  - name: \"Real-data validation on Ashwin et al. (2025)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-004\"\n    description: >\n      在 Ashwin et al. (2025) Rohingya 难民访谈数据集上应用 EC-HTE。该数据集中 LLM 标注错误\n      与 refugee status、gender、education 相关。使用 GPT-4.1 和 Qwen3 标注 effect modifiers，\n      获取/模拟 expert labels（200-500 条），比较 EC-HTE vs baselines 的 CATE 估计。\n    expected_results:\n      refugee_status_error_rate_gpt4: 0.11\n      host_community_error_rate_gpt4: 0.21\n      female_error_rate_gpt4: 0.18\n      male_error_rate_gpt4: 0.09\n      low_education_error_rate_gpt4: 0.24\n      high_education_error_rate_gpt4: 0.08\n      max_min_error_ratio_by_status: 1.91\n      max_min_error_ratio_by_gender: 2.00\n      max_min_error_ratio_by_education: 3.00\n      global_vs_nocorrection_amplification_status: 4.2\n      global_vs_nocorrection_amplification_gender: 5.1\n      global_vs_nocorrection_amplification_education: 6.7\n      ec_hte_bias_reduction_status: 0.87\n      ec_hte_bias_reduction_gender: 0.91\n      ec_hte_bias_reduction_education: 0.93\n      ec_hte_coverage_status: 0.93\n      ec_hte_coverage_gender: 0.94\n    result_rationale: >\n      Ashwin et al. (2025) 已文献记录 LLM 标注错误与人口学特征的相关性。Education 维度异质性最大\n      （ratio 3.0x）因为低教育受访者使用非标准语言、方言混杂，LLM 理解困难；refugee status 次之\n      （ratio 1.91x）因为难民受访者的创伤性叙述增加标注难度。Gender 维度的异质性来源于女性受访者\n      更多涉及家庭暴力等敏感话题，LLM 在情感分类上表现更差。\n      Global correction amplification 在 education 维度最高（6.7x）因为 Δπ 和 Δτ 都大——\n      低教育群体同时有高 misclassification 和不同的 treatment effect pattern。\n      EC-HTE 在所有维度上有效但改善幅度不如合成数据大（因为 n_expert 有限且真实数据更嘈杂），\n      education 维度上 reduction 最高因为异质性最大、correction 价值最高。\n      Coverage 略低于合成实验因为真实数据可能存在模型未捕捉的额外异质性。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 10: Subgroup-specific misclassification rates by demographic dimension\"\n        columns: [\"dimension\", \"subgroup\", \"n\", \"misclass_rate_gpt4\", \"misclass_rate_qwen3\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"refugee_status\", \"refugee\", 1200, 0.11, 0.16]\n          - [\"refugee_status\", \"host_community\", 800, 0.21, 0.29]\n          - [\"gender\", \"male\", 950, 0.09, 0.14]\n          - [\"gender\", \"female\", 1050, 0.18, 0.25]\n          - [\"education\", \"high\", 600, 0.08, 0.12]\n          - [\"education\", \"low\", 1400, 0.24, 0.33]\n      - title: \"Table 11: CATE correction results by dimension (GPT-4.1, education subgroup)\"\n        columns: [\"method\", \"subgroup\", \"CATE_est\", \"bias_est\", \"RMSE\", \"coverage\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"No correction\", \"high_edu\", \"0.082\", \"-0.008\", \"0.015\", \"0.90\"]\n          - [\"No correction\", \"low_edu\", \"0.031\", \"0.019\", \"0.024\", \"0.83\"]\n          - [\"Global correction\", \"high_edu\", \"0.082 → 0.135\", \"0.045\", \"0.049\", \"0.65\"]\n          - [\"Global correction\", \"low_edu\", \"0.031 → -0.012\", \"-0.062\", \"0.067\", \"0.58\"]\n          - [\"EC-HTE\", \"high_edu\", \"0.082 → 0.093\", \"0.003\", \"0.013\", \"0.94\"]\n          - [\"EC-HTE\", \"low_edu\", \"0.031 → 0.054\", \"0.004\", \"0.014\", \"0.93\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 8: 三维度（status/gender/education）的 misclassification rate heterogeneity paired dot plot，每个维度两个点连线，展示真实数据中异质性模式。\"\n      - \"Fig 9: Education 维度的 CATE 估计比较——forest plot 样式，展示各方法在两个 subgroup 上的点估计和 CI，EC-HTE 覆盖 true value 而 global correction 偏移严重。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Real-data 实验验证了合成/semi-synthetic 发现在真实场景中的外部效度。Education 维度的 6.7x\n      amplification 尤其有说服力——这是一个政策相关的 CATE 差异（教育干预对低教育群体的效果），\n      global correction 不仅无法纠正 bias 反而将 CATE 估计推向负值（暗示干预有害），\n      这在政策决策中可能造成严重后果。该结果为论文提供了\"stakes are real\"的叙事素材。\n      Coverage 的 65%/58% 在 global correction 下表明不仅点估计有 bias，CI 也严重 miscalibrated。\n\n  - name: \"Diagnostic criterion ROC validation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-005\"\n    description: >\n      从 exp-001/exp-003/exp-004 所有实验设置中提取 (Δπ, Δτ) 对和对应的\"global correction 是否有害\"\n      binary label（定义为 bias_global > bias_nocorrection），计算 Δπ×Δτ product 作为 diagnostic score，\n      进行 ROC 分析。验证 Claim 3（diagnostic criterion）。\n    expected_results:\n      diagnostic_auc: 0.953\n      optimal_threshold_product: 0.008\n      sensitivity_at_optimal: 0.93\n      specificity_at_optimal: 0.88\n      ppv_at_optimal: 0.91\n      npv_at_optimal: 0.90\n      auc_synthetic_only: 0.971\n      auc_semisynthetic_only: 0.938\n      auc_realdata_only: 0.929\n      n_settings_evaluated: 342\n      n_positive_cases: 187  # global correction harmful\n      n_negative_cases: 155  # global correction not harmful\n    result_rationale: >\n      Diagnostic AUC 0.953 的来源：Δπ×Δτ product 是 bias 的一阶充分统计量（exp-002 已证明 R²≈0.98），\n      而\"global correction 有害\"本质上是\"bias > threshold\"的决策问题。一阶统计量作为 classifier\n      天然具有高 discriminative power。AUC 未达 1.0 因为：(1) sample size、base rate 等二阶因素\n      影响 bias 幅度但未被 product 捕捉；(2) 阈值定义的边界情况（amplification ≈ 1x）无法被\n      任何单一统计量完美分类。Synthetic-only AUC 最高因为 DGP 完全受控，semi-synthetic 次之因为\n      注入了已知 CATE 结构，real-data 最低因为 ground truth CATE 有估计误差。\n      Optimal threshold 0.008 意味着即使轻度异质性（如 Δπ=0.04, Δτ=0.20）也建议使用 stratified correction。\n      这支持论文的\"conservative\"建议：除非确认 homogeneity，否则默认使用 EC-HTE。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 12: Diagnostic criterion ROC analysis\"\n        columns: [\"data_source\", \"n_settings\", \"AUC\", \"optimal_threshold\", \"sensitivity\", \"specificity\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Synthetic (exp-001/002)\", 240, 0.971, 0.007, 0.95, 0.92]\n          - [\"Semi-synthetic (exp-003)\", 72, 0.938, 0.009, 0.91, 0.86]\n          - [\"Real data (exp-004)\", 30, 0.929, 0.010, 0.90, 0.83]\n          - [\"Combined\", 342, 0.953, 0.008, 0.93, 0.88]\n      - title: \"Table 13: Confusion matrix at optimal threshold (combined)\"\n        columns: [\"\", \"Predicted: use stratified\", \"Predicted: global OK\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Actual: global harmful\", 174, 13]\n          - [\"Actual: global OK\", 19, 136]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 10: ROC 曲线，三条线对应 synthetic/semi-synthetic/real-data，加 combined。AUC 值标注在图例中。对角虚线。\"\n      - \"Fig 11: Calibration scatter plot，x 轴 Δπ×Δτ product，y 轴 actual bias amplification factor，颜色编码 data source。展示 product 与 amplification 的单调关系，垂直虚线标注 optimal threshold。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Diagnostic criterion 的高 AUC（0.953）赋予它独立的实用价值——研究者可在不实施 EC-HTE 的情况下，\n      仅通过 pilot study 估计 Δπ 和 Δτ 来判断是否需要 stratified correction。这降低了方法的采用门槛。\n      Threshold 0.008 相对保守，意味着对多数实际场景建议 stratified correction，与 HB partial pooling\n      的\"never worse\"性质一致——即使不需要时使用 EC-HTE 也仅有微小效率损失。\n\n  - name: \"Expert label budget sensitivity sweep\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-006\"\n    description: >\n      系统性 budget sweep：n_expert ∈ {50, 100, 250, 500, 1000, 2000} × K ∈ {2, 4, 8} subgroups，\n      在 extreme regime 下。找到 EC-HTE 优于 Global correction 的 crossover point。\n      验证 HB partial pooling 在极小样本下的稳健性。\n    expected_results:\n      crossover_n_k2: 85  # n_expert at which EC-HTE first beats Global\n      crossover_n_k4: 140\n      crossover_n_k8: 210\n      ec_hte_rmse_at_n50_k2: 0.031\n      global_rmse_at_n50_k2: 0.042\n      ec_hte_still_better_at_n50_k2: true\n      ec_hte_rmse_at_n50_k8: 0.058  # K=8 时 50 labels 不够\n      global_rmse_at_n50_k8: 0.042\n      ec_hte_worse_at_n50_k8: true  # 此时 EC-HTE 反而更差\n      hb_vs_mle_rmse_ratio_at_n50_k4: 0.61  # HB 比 MLE 好 39%\n      hb_vs_mle_rmse_ratio_at_n100_k4: 0.69\n      hb_vs_mle_rmse_ratio_at_n250_k4: 0.78\n      hb_vs_mle_rmse_ratio_at_n2000_k4: 0.96\n      coverage_hb_at_n50_k2: 0.91\n      coverage_hb_at_n50_k8: 0.84  # undercoverage at extreme budget constraint\n    result_rationale: >\n      Crossover point 在 K=2 时约 n=85 因为：每 subgroup ~42 个 labels 足以让 HB Dirichlet 估计\n      的 confusion matrix 优于 pooled matrix 的 systematic bias。K=4 时 crossover 上升到 ~140\n      （每 subgroup ~35 labels），K=8 时 ~210（每 subgroup ~26 labels）。在 K=8, n=50 时\n      （每 subgroup 仅 ~6 labels）HB 估计方差过大，EC-HTE 反而不如 global——这是合理的，\n      反映了 bias-variance tradeoff 的基本限制。但这不削弱论文结论，因为 K=8 × n=50 是极端设定，\n      实践中 K=2-4 且 n≥250 是常见配置。HB 相对 MLE 的优势在 K=4 × n=50 时最显著（39% RMSE reduction），\n      因为每 subgroup 仅 ~12 labels，MLE 方差爆炸而 HB 有效收缩。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 14: Crossover analysis (extreme regime, K=2)\"\n        columns: [\"n_expert\", \"n_per_subgroup\", \"EC-HTE_RMSE\", \"Global_RMSE\", \"EC-HTE_better\"]\n        rows:\n          - [50, 25, 0.031, 0.042, \"✓\"]\n          - [100, 50, 0.022, 0.042, \"✓\"]\n          - [250, 125, 0.015, 0.042, \"✓\"]\n          - [500, 250, 0.011, 0.042, \"✓\"]\n          - [1000, 500, 0.008, 0.042, \"✓\"]\n          - [2000, 1000, 0.006, 0.042, \"✓\"]\n      - title: \"Table 15: Budget crossover by K\"\n        columns: [\"K\", \"crossover_n\", \"n_per_subgroup_at_crossover\", \"EC-HTE_RMSE_at_crossover\", \"Global_RMSE\"]\n        rows:\n          - [2, 85, 42, 0.041, 0.042]\n          - [4, 140, 35, 0.041, 0.042]\n          - [8, 210, 26, 0.041, 0.042]\n      - title: \"Table 16: K=8 failure mode\"\n        columns: [\"n_expert\", \"n_per_subgroup\", \"HB_RMSE\", \"MLE_RMSE\", \"Global_RMSE\", \"HB_coverage\"]\n        rows:\n          - [50, 6, 0.058, 0.093, 0.042, 0.84]\n          - [100, 12, 0.039, 0.061, 0.042, 0.90]\n          - [250, 31, 0.025, 0.034, 0.042, 0.94]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 12: Budget crossover curves——x 轴 n_expert (log scale)，y 轴 RMSE，每个 K 值一组 EC-HTE vs Global 交叉曲线。Global 水平线因为它不使用 subgroup-specific labels。交叉点标注。\"\n      - \"Fig 13: HB vs MLE RMSE ratio heatmap，x 轴 n_expert，y 轴 K，颜色深浅表示 HB 优势程度。左上角（小 n，大 K）HB 优势最大。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Budget sensitivity 分析给出实用建议：对典型设置（K=2-4），250 个 expert labels 即足够；\n      K=8 时需要至少 ~210 labels。在 K=8 × n=50 的极端情况下 EC-HTE 劣于 Global，\n      但这是 honest limitation 不是缺陷——论文应在 robustness section 报告并建议\n      n_expert ≥ 30K 作为使用 EC-HTE 的经验法则。HB partial pooling 在所有 K 下都优于 MLE，\n      且优势随 K 增大而增大——直接支撑 HB 选择的 motivation。\n\n  - name: \"PPCI baseline comparison and orthogonality demonstration\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-007\"\n    description: >\n      实现 PPCI（Sui et al., 2026）kernel-based conditional correction，与 EC-HTE 在相同 benchmark 上对比。\n      设计三种 error scenarios：(a) covariate-side only（LLM effect modifier 有误），\n      (b) outcome-side only（outcome measurement 有误），(c) both。验证 EC-HTE 和 PPCI 的正交性，\n      并尝试 composition（EC-HTE + PPCI 联合校正）。\n    expected_results:\n      # Scenario A: covariate-side error only\n      ppci_bias_covariate_error: 0.089  # PPCI 对 covariate-side error 无效\n      ec_hte_bias_covariate_error: 0.005\n      global_bias_covariate_error: 0.043\n      nocorrection_bias_covariate_error: 0.021\n      ppci_relative_bias_covariate: 0.93  # |bias|/|true_cate|，PPCI 几乎不改善\n      # Scenario B: outcome-side error only\n      ppci_bias_outcome_error: 0.004\n      ec_hte_bias_outcome_error: 0.018  # EC-HTE 对 outcome-side error 无效\n      global_bias_outcome_error: 0.019\n      nocorrection_bias_outcome_error: 0.020\n      # Scenario C: both errors\n      ppci_bias_both_errors: 0.082\n      ec_hte_bias_both_errors: 0.017\n      composition_bias_both_errors: 0.006  # EC-HTE + PPCI composition\n      nocorrection_bias_both_errors: 0.038\n      # Orthogonality metrics\n      ec_hte_ppci_correlation: 0.04  # near-zero correlation of correction terms\n      composition_improvement_over_best_single: 0.65  # in scenario C, composition bias / min(ec_hte, ppci) bias\n    result_rationale: >\n      PPCI 设计用于校正 outcome-side measurement error 对 conditional functionals 的影响，\n      通过 kernel 局部化实现条件校正。当 error 来自 covariate-side（effect modifier misclassification），\n      PPCI 的 kernel 无法定位到正确的 conditioning point——它试图在 mislabeled 的 X 空间中做局部校正，\n      但问题根源是 X 本身被错误分配。因此 PPCI bias 在 scenario A 中几乎不减少（relative bias 0.93）。\n      反过来，EC-HTE 仅校正 confusion matrix 引入的 covariate misclassification，对 outcome noise\n      不作处理，因此在 scenario B 中无效。这种正交性意味着在 scenario C（两种 error 同时存在）中，\n      composition（先 EC-HTE 校正 covariate-side，再 PPCI 校正 outcome-side）可将 bias 降至 0.006，\n      远优于任一单独方法。Correction terms 的近零相关性（r=0.04）进一步确认正交性。\n      这个结果干净地回答了 reviewer concern #2，且 composition 结果超越了\"仅证明不同\"的防守定位，\n      给出了\"可以组合\"的积极贡献。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 17: Head-to-head comparison across error scenarios\"\n        columns: [\"scenario\", \"method\", \"mean_abs_bias\", \"RMSE\", \"coverage_95\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"A: covariate-side\", \"No correction\", 0.021, 0.027, 0.87]\n          - [\"A: covariate-side\", \"Global correction\", 0.043, 0.048, 0.72]\n          - [\"A: covariate-side\", \"PPCI\", 0.089, 0.094, 0.58]\n          - [\"A: covariate-side\", \"EC-HTE\", 0.005, 0.012, 0.94]\n          - [\"B: outcome-side\", \"No correction\", 0.020, 0.025, 0.88]\n          - [\"B: outcome-side\", \"Global correction\", 0.019, 0.024, 0.88]\n          - [\"B: outcome-side\", \"PPCI\", 0.004, 0.010, 0.95]\n          - [\"B: outcome-side\", \"EC-HTE\", 0.018, 0.023, 0.89]\n          - [\"C: both\", \"No correction\", 0.038, 0.044, 0.82]\n          - [\"C: both\", \"Global correction\", 0.057, 0.063, 0.68]\n          - [\"C: both\", \"PPCI\", 0.082, 0.088, 0.61]\n          - [\"C: both\", \"EC-HTE\", 0.017, 0.023, 0.89]\n          - [\"C: both\", \"EC-HTE + PPCI\", 0.006, 0.012, 0.94]\n      - title: \"Table 18: Orthogonality evidence\"\n        columns: [\"metric\", \"value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Correlation of EC-HTE and PPCI correction terms\", 0.04]\n          - [\"EC-HTE bias reduction in scenario A\", \"76%\"]\n          - [\"EC-HTE bias reduction in scenario B\", \"10%\"]\n          - [\"PPCI bias reduction in scenario A\", \"-324%\"]\n          - [\"PPCI bias reduction in scenario B\", \"80%\"]\n          - [\"Composition bias reduction in scenario C (vs no correction)\", \"84%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 14: 2×3 panel plot，行=method（EC-HTE / PPCI），列=scenario（A/B/C），每个 panel 展示 subgroup-level bias bar chart。清晰可视化各方法在其'on-target'和'off-target'scenario 下的表现差异。\"\n      - \"Fig 15: Scenario C 的 sequential correction 示意图——原始 bias → EC-HTE 校正后 → EC-HTE+PPCI 校正后，waterfall chart 展示两步 correction 的累积效果。\"\n    analysis: >\n      PPCI 在 covariate-side error scenario 下不仅无效，反而因为在错误的 conditioning space 中做\n      kernel 局部化而恶化 bias（从 0.021 增至 0.089）——这是本实验最重要的发现，比预期更强。\n      正交性论证无懈可击：(1) theoretical——两个方法校正不同类型的 error；(2) empirical——correction terms\n      近零相关；(3) constructive——composition 在 scenario C 中给出最优结果。\n      这将 reviewer concern #2 从\"我们不同于 PPCI\"升级为\"我们与 PPCI 互补\"，是正面贡献而非防守性解释。\n      Note: PPCI 在 scenario A 中恶化 bias 不应被解读为 PPCI 有缺陷——它本就不设计用于 covariate-side error。\n      论文应 frame 为\"applying the wrong correction is worse than no correction\"，这恰好也是\n      我们对 global correction 的核心论点。\n\n  - name: \"Multiple LLM annotator comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-008\"\n    description: >\n      在 semi-synthetic benchmark（exp-003 同一数据集）上比较 GPT-4.1、Qwen3-235B-A22B、\n      Claude Sonnet 4.6 三个 LLM 的标注质量和 EC-HTE 收益。测量 misclassification heterogeneity\n      模式差异，验证 EC-HTE benefit 随 LLM 质量变化。\n    expected_results:\n      gpt4_accuracy: 0.87\n      qwen3_accuracy: 0.82\n      claude_sonnet_accuracy: 0.89\n      gpt4_error_heterogeneity_delta_pi: 0.15\n      qwen3_error_heterogeneity_delta_pi: 0.17\n      claude_sonnet_error_heterogeneity_delta_pi: 0.11\n      ec_hte_improvement_gpt4: 0.89  # bias reduction fraction\n      ec_hte_improvement_qwen3: 0.92\n      ec_hte_improvement_claude: 0.85\n      global_amplification_gpt4: 5.4\n      global_amplification_qwen3: 6.9\n      global_amplification_claude: 4.1\n      error_pattern_correlation_gpt4_qwen3: 0.72\n      error_pattern_correlation_gpt4_claude: 0.68\n      error_pattern_correlation_qwen3_claude: 0.74\n    result_rationale: >\n      Claude Sonnet 4.6 总体准确率最高（0.89）但仍有显著 subgroup 异质性（Δπ=0.11），\n      因为异质性的根源（不同 subgroup 在预训练数据中的表达频率差异）在所有 LLM 中结构相似。\n      Qwen3 异质性最大因为中文中心预训练导致英文政治语料的 subgroup 差异被放大。\n      EC-HTE improvement 与异质性正相关（Qwen3 最高 0.92，Claude 最低 0.85），符合理论预测。\n      三个 LLM 的 error pattern 有中等相关（0.68-0.74），反映共同的\"低资源 subgroup 更难\"模式，\n      但具体 error 分布不同——这建议如果使用多 LLM ensemble，应对每个 LLM 独立估计 confusion matrix。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 19: LLM comparison summary\"\n        columns: [\"LLM\", \"accuracy\", \"Δπ\", \"bias_amplification_global\", \"ec_hte_bias_reduction\", \"ec_hte_RMSE\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GPT-4.1\", 0.87, 0.15, \"5.4x\", \"89%\", 0.014]\n          - [\"Qwen3-235B-A22B\", 0.82, 0.17, \"6.9x\", \"92%\", 0.016]\n          - [\"Claude Sonnet 4.6\", 0.89, 0.11, \"4.1x\", \"85%\", 0.012]\n      - title: \"Table 20: Cross-LLM error pattern correlations\"\n        columns: [\"\", \"GPT-4.1\", \"Qwen3\", \"Claude Sonnet\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GPT-4.1\", \"1.00\", \"0.72\", \"0.68\"]\n          - [\"Qwen3\", \"0.72\", \"1.00\", \"0.74\"]\n          - [\"Claude Sonnet\", \"0.68\", \"0.74\", \"1.00\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A1 (appendix): 三 LLM 的 subgroup-specific error rate parallel coordinates plot，每条线是一个 subgroup，x 轴三个 LLM，y 轴 error rate。展示 subgroup 排序在 LLM 间大致一致但幅度不同。\"\n    analysis: >\n      关键发现：即使最准确的 LLM（Claude Sonnet 4.6, acc=0.89）仍产生 4.1x bias amplification under\n      global correction，且 EC-HTE 带来 85% bias reduction。这说明问题不会随 LLM 进步自动消失——\n      只要存在 subgroup heterogeneity（哪怕较小），global correction 就有害。\n      该实验适合放 appendix，作为 generalizability evidence。\n\n  - name: \"Adaptive expert annotation allocation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-009\"\n    description: >\n      实现 CATE-weighted adaptive allocation：将 expert label budget 不均匀分配至 subgroups，\n      优先标注 high-CATE × high-error subgroups。比较 uniform、uncertainty-only、CATE-weighted 三种策略。\n    expected_results:\n      uniform_rmse_at_n250_k4: 0.027\n      uncertainty_only_rmse_at_n250_k4: 0.023\n      cate_weighted_rmse_at_n250_k4: 0.020\n      cate_weighted_improvement_vs_uniform: 0.26  # 26% RMSE reduction\n      cate_weighted_improvement_vs_uncertainty: 0.13\n      uniform_allocation_per_subgroup: [62, 63, 62, 63]\n      cate_weighted_allocation_per_subgroup: [95, 75, 50, 30]  # high-CATE×high-error first\n      efficiency_gain_equivalent_n: 340  # uniform needs n=340 to match CATE-weighted at n=250\n    result_rationale: >\n      CATE-weighted allocation 优于 uniform 因为 EC-HTE 的 estimation error 不是在各 subgroup 上\n      均匀分布的——high-CATE subgroup 的 confusion matrix 估计误差对总 RMSE 的贡献与 τ_k² 成正比\n      （通过 error propagation）。同时 high-error subgroup 的 confusion matrix 需要更多 labels\n      才能达到同等精度。CATE-weighted 策略同时优化这两个维度。Uncertainty-only 策略仅关注 confusion matrix\n      估计不确定性，忽略 CATE 权重，因此次优。效率增益等价于 n=340 的 uniform allocation，\n      即 CATE-weighted 用 250 labels 达到 uniform 340 labels 的效果。\n      这是 P2 实验，放 appendix，作为 practical extension。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table A1: Allocation strategy comparison (K=4, extreme regime)\"\n        columns: [\"strategy\", \"n_total\", \"allocation\", \"RMSE\", \"coverage\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Uniform\", 250, \"[62,63,62,63]\", 0.027, 0.940]\n          - [\"Uncertainty-only\", 250, \"[78,72,55,45]\", 0.023, 0.945]\n          - [\"CATE-weighted\", 250, \"[95,75,50,30]\", 0.020, 0.948]\n          - [\"Uniform (matched)\", 340, \"[85,85,85,85]\", 0.020, 0.949]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A2: Allocation strategy comparison bar chart，三种策略的 RMSE 和 efficiency-equivalent n。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Adaptive allocation 是自然的 practical extension，但 RMSE improvement 适中（26% vs uniform），\n      且增加实现复杂度（需要 CATE 的初步估计来指导 allocation）。适合 appendix 作为 future direction\n      而非主实验。论文可提一句\"with adaptive allocation, budget requirements drop further\"。\n\n  - name: \"Robustness to misspecified subgroup structure\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-010\"\n    description: >\n      测试 EC-HTE 在 subgroup 结构 misspecified 时的表现：(a) 使用 coarsened subgroups（真实 K=4，\n      model 用 K=2），(b) 使用 noisy subgroup assignment（10-30% subgroup label noise），\n      (c) continuous heterogeneity（Δπ 连续变化但 model 用 discrete bins）。\n    expected_results:\n      # (a) Coarsened subgroups\n      coarsened_ec_hte_rmse: 0.019  # vs oracle K=4 的 0.014\n      coarsened_ec_hte_bias: 0.008  # 有 residual bias 因为 within-merged-group heterogeneity\n      coarsened_global_rmse: 0.042  # global 不受影响\n      coarsened_ec_hte_still_better: true\n      # (b) Noisy subgroup assignment\n      noise_10pct_ec_hte_rmse: 0.016\n      noise_20pct_ec_hte_rmse: 0.021\n      noise_30pct_ec_hte_rmse: 0.028\n      noise_30pct_global_rmse: 0.042\n      noise_breakeven_pct: 0.38  # EC-HTE = Global at ~38% noise\n      # (c) Continuous heterogeneity\n      continuous_binned_k2_rmse: 0.022\n      continuous_binned_k4_rmse: 0.017\n      continuous_binned_k8_rmse: 0.015\n      continuous_global_rmse: 0.042\n    result_rationale: >\n      HB partial pooling 提供对 misspecification 的自然鲁棒性：(a) 当 subgroups 过粗时，\n      merged group 内仍有 residual heterogeneity，但 EC-HTE 的 bias（0.008）仍远小于 global（0.043），\n      因为即使粗化的 stratification 也捕获了大部分跨组差异。(b) Noisy subgroup assignment\n      导致 confusion matrix 估计被污染（cross-contamination），RMSE 随 noise 线性增长，\n      但由于 HB shrinkage 的稳定性，即使 30% noise 下 EC-HTE（0.028）仍优于 global（0.042），\n      breakeven 在约 38% noise——远超实际场景中可能的 subgroup misclassification level。\n      (c) Continuous heterogeneity 下 discretization 是一种 approximation error，更细的 binning\n      更好但受 per-bin sample size 限制；K=4 是 good default，K=8 marginal improvement 不值 cost。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table A2: Robustness analysis summary\"\n        columns: [\"scenario\", \"EC-HTE_RMSE\", \"Global_RMSE\", \"EC-HTE_still_better\", \"degradation_vs_oracle\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Oracle (K=4, no noise)\", 0.014, 0.042, \"✓\", \"baseline\"]\n          - [\"Coarsened (K=2)\", 0.019, 0.042, \"✓\", \"+36%\"]\n          - [\"Noise 10%\", 0.016, 0.042, \"✓\", \"+14%\"]\n          - [\"Noise 20%\", 0.021, 0.042, \"✓\", \"+50%\"]\n          - [\"Noise 30%\", 0.028, 0.042, \"✓\", \"+100%\"]\n          - [\"Noise 38%\", 0.042, 0.042, \"—\", \"breakeven\"]\n          - [\"Continuous, K=4 bins\", 0.017, 0.042, \"✓\", \"+21%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A3: RMSE vs subgroup noise level 折线图，EC-HTE 上升曲线 vs Global 水平线，交叉点标注 breakeven。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Robustness 分析的核心结论：EC-HTE 在相当宽的 misspecification 范围内保持优势，\n      breakeven noise level（38%）远超实际场景。这直接回应 reviewer concern #4。\n      HB partial pooling 是关键——当 subgroup 结构 noisy 时，HB 自动向 global 收缩，\n      限制了 misspecification 的损害。该实验适合 appendix。\n\n  - name: \"Causal forest integration\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-011\"\n    description: >\n      将 EC-HTE 与 CausalForestDML 集成：(a) post-hoc correction——先用 LLM labels 训练 causal forest\n      得到 subgroup CATE，再用 EC-HTE 校正；(b) corrected pseudo-outcomes——用 EC-HTE 校正后的\n      pseudo-outcomes 重新训练 causal forest，with variance-adjusted CIs。\n      比较 naive forest、globally-corrected forest、EC-HTE corrected forest。\n    expected_results:\n      naive_forest_subgroup_bias: 0.024\n      global_corrected_forest_subgroup_bias: 0.051\n      ec_hte_posthoc_forest_bias: 0.007\n      ec_hte_pseudooutcome_forest_bias: 0.005\n      naive_forest_coverage: 0.88\n      global_corrected_forest_coverage: 0.73\n      ec_hte_posthoc_forest_coverage: 0.93\n      ec_hte_pseudooutcome_forest_coverage: 0.95\n      naive_forest_rmse: 0.029\n      ec_hte_posthoc_forest_rmse: 0.015\n      ec_hte_pseudooutcome_forest_rmse: 0.013\n      cate_heterogeneity_detection_power_naive: 0.62\n      cate_heterogeneity_detection_power_ec_hte: 0.89\n    result_rationale: >\n      Naive causal forest 继承 LLM label noise 作为 covariate measurement error，导致 CATE 估计\n      有 attenuation bias。Global correction 将 correction 均匀应用于所有 leaf nodes，\n      但不同 leaf 的 subgroup composition 不同，因此产生与 subgroup-level 分析相同的 over/under-correction。\n      EC-HTE post-hoc correction 在 forest 训练后按 subgroup 调整，消除 systematic bias 但\n      不能修正 forest 本身因 noisy covariates 导致的 split quality degradation。\n      EC-HTE pseudo-outcome approach 更优因为在 forest 训练前就校正了 pseudo-outcomes，\n      使 forest 在 cleaner data 上学习，同时 variance adjustment 使 CI 正确反映 confusion matrix 不确定性。\n      Heterogeneity detection power 从 0.62 提升至 0.89 是因为 bias 的 removal 使得真实的 CATE\n      heterogeneity signal 不再被 noise-induced 的 spurious heterogeneity 混淆。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 21: Causal forest integration comparison\"\n        columns: [\"method\", \"subgroup_bias\", \"RMSE\", \"coverage_95\", \"het_detection_power\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Naive CausalForest\", 0.024, 0.029, 0.88, 0.62]\n          - [\"Global-corrected CausalForest\", 0.051, 0.056, 0.73, 0.55]\n          - [\"EC-HTE post-hoc CausalForest\", 0.007, 0.015, 0.93, 0.85]\n          - [\"EC-HTE pseudo-outcome CausalForest\", 0.005, 0.013, 0.95, 0.89]\n          - [\"Oracle CausalForest (true labels)\", 0.002, 0.010, 0.95, 0.93]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 16: CATE estimate scatter plot，four methods，x 轴 true CATE，y 轴 estimated CATE。Naive 和 global 偏离 45° 线，EC-HTE 两种方式紧贴。\"\n      - \"Fig 17: Heterogeneity detection ROC curves——naive forest 的低 power 表明它无法可靠区分真实 heterogeneity 和 noise-induced variation，EC-HTE correction 恢复 detection ability。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Causal forest integration 证明 EC-HTE 不限于 simple difference-in-means CATE estimator，\n      可与现代 ML-based CATE 方法无缝集成。Pseudo-outcome approach 接近 oracle performance\n      （bias 0.005 vs 0.002），仅有 confusion matrix 估计噪声的 residual gap。\n      Global correction 在 forest 中同样有害（bias 从 0.024 恶化至 0.051），与 subgroup-level\n      分析一致——进一步强化 paper 的核心 message。\n      Heterogeneity detection power 的提升（0.62→0.89）有重要实际意义：\n      它意味着 EC-HTE 不仅改善 point estimation，还改善了\"发现 heterogeneity\"的 statistical power。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"d3e925fc-24dd-4c87-b2ac-ec185e0a37c4","total_cost_usd":0.55974625,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10103,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":19419,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10103,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":19419,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10103,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10103},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":5077,"outputTokens":24,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.005197,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":19419,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":10103,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.55454925,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"c7573927-8c1e-47ab-b1d3-9abc61b5fcc9"}
